(2423288, 333354, 59058, '<td valign="top">Lovely! ''Tho I''d like to see the starfish in whole without it''s bottom left end cropped off, the contrast looks good here coupled with the texture on the starfish.</td>', 'Lovely! ''Tho I''d like to see the starfish in whole without it''s bottom left end cropped off, the contrast looks good here coupled with the texture on the starfish.', '2006-05-17 03:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
