(2423313, 335056, 16477, '<td valign="top">Nice BW</td>', 'Nice BW', '2006-05-17 03:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423320, 334427, 37879, '<td valign="top">Looks too "fake" for my taste (oversharpened?).  Nice vivid colors, though.</td>', 'Looks too "fake" for my taste (oversharpened?).  Nice vivid colors, though.', '2006-05-17 03:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423326, 334465, 37879, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Perhaps a tad underexposed?  More light will make the flowers really "pop"...also not a huge fan of the line border.  I love the composition.</td>', 'Great colors.  Perhaps a tad underexposed?  More light will make the flowers really "pop"...also not a huge fan of the line border.  I love the composition.', '2006-05-17 03:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423330, 335460, 59058, '<td valign="top">What a sweet success :) Love the goldness in this, and I find the red rose a very good subject here in toning down the glaring brightness of the gold especially after you look too long at the highlights on the letter blocks.</td>', 'What a sweet success :) Love the goldness in this, and I find the red rose a very good subject here in toning down the glaring brightness of the gold especially after you look too long at the highlights on the letter blocks.', '2006-05-17 03:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423332, 335465, 37879, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark to tell what this is...also, the blurred candle on the right is demanding attention, even though it appears that whatever is in the background should be the main subject.</td>', 'A bit too dark to tell what this is...also, the blurred candle on the right is demanding attention, even though it appears that whatever is in the background should be the main subject.', '2006-05-17 03:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423336, 334680, 37879, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what all of these items have to do with each other.  Other than the red apple, I do love the subtle colors.  Lighting is beautiful.</td>', 'I don''t understand what all of these items have to do with each other.  Other than the red apple, I do love the subtle colors.  Lighting is beautiful.', '2006-05-17 03:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423339, 332950, 16477, '<td valign="top">Great</td>', 'Great', '2006-05-17 03:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423342, 335442, 37879, '<td valign="top">Excellent set up.  The glare from the flash bothers me a bit...makes the watch/earrings(?) look glossy &amp; new...the subtle tones would look really great using a softer lightsource (window light, etc.)  The texture in the book is incredible!</td>', 'Excellent set up.  The glare from the flash bothers me a bit...makes the watch/earrings(?) look glossy & new...the subtle tones would look really great using a softer lightsource (window light, etc.)  The texture in the book is incredible!', '2006-05-17 03:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423346, 335477, 37879, '<td valign="top">I love how these are on the verge of a crack.  Reminds me of the story of the sower sowing his seeds in the rocks.  The two round bushes at top are a bit distracting.  Colors are lovely.</td>', 'I love how these are on the verge of a crack.  Reminds me of the story of the sower sowing his seeds in the rocks.  The two round bushes at top are a bit distracting.  Colors are lovely.', '2006-05-17 03:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423348, 334465, 59058, '<td valign="top">Should have excluded the reddish buds to have a family of purely yellow flowers. Love the use of different shapes and sizes of containers :) Nice contrast between the blue background and the yellow flowers.</td>', 'Should have excluded the reddish buds to have a family of purely yellow flowers. Love the use of different shapes and sizes of containers :) Nice contrast between the blue background and the yellow flowers.', '2006-05-17 03:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423350, 334748, 16477, '<td valign="top">NO diamond  rings for the  bride? Just kidding. One of the most different entry, best of luck</td>', 'NO diamond  rings for the  bride? Just kidding. One of the most different entry, best of luck', '2006-05-17 03:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423356, 333804, 37879, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit flat and underexposed.  The wine bottle &amp; grapes looks black...I bet if you brighten up the levels those will become a lovely deep purple.  The cheese looks yummy.</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit flat and underexposed.  The wine bottle & grapes looks black...I bet if you brighten up the levels those will become a lovely deep purple.  The cheese looks yummy.', '2006-05-17 03:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423357, 335342, 37879, '<td valign="top">Very unique.  I''m not real sure what''s going on here, but an excellent abstract.</td>', 'Very unique.  I''m not real sure what''s going on here, but an excellent abstract.', '2006-05-17 03:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423363, 335534, 37879, '<td valign="top">Looks a tad underexposed.  Also, this may be better at a slightly higher camera angle. Great subject for still life.</td>', 'Looks a tad underexposed.  Also, this may be better at a slightly higher camera angle. Great subject for still life.', '2006-05-17 03:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423368, 333588, 59058, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and idea, but what made me smile when I looked at this was the withering and drying flowers in the bottle LOL ...</td>', 'Nice concept and idea, but what made me smile when I looked at this was the withering and drying flowers in the bottle LOL ...', '2006-05-17 03:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423370, 335487, 37879, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and texture.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and texture.', '2006-05-17 03:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423373, 334937, 37879, '<td valign="top">This is a floral that really stands out (no pun intended).  I think you made it different by accentuating the "stand out" with limited DOF as well as the obvious color difference.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is a floral that really stands out (no pun intended).  I think you made it different by accentuating the "stand out" with limited DOF as well as the obvious color difference.  Nice work.', '2006-05-17 03:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423374, 334688, 37879, '<td valign="top">Great texture from your side lighting!</td>', 'Great texture from your side lighting!', '2006-05-17 03:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423376, 335345, 37879, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Do you see the 2 little eyes &amp; frowning face on the pawn? He''s watching me!</td>', 'Whoa!  Do you see the 2 little eyes & frowning face on the pawn? He''s watching me!', '2006-05-17 03:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423381, 335258, 59058, '<td valign="top">Clean and pretty. Love the touch of pink inside the rather monotoned saucer and cup :)</td>', 'Clean and pretty. Love the touch of pink inside the rather monotoned saucer and cup :)', '2006-05-17 03:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2423385, 333669, 37879, '<td valign="top">Great coloring of the light (reminds me of neon lights in a bar more than a sunset)...however the fall off is rapid making the tanning oil and shoe (?) too dark.  I''d suggest using a stronger light, 2nd light, move the light to the other side, or swap your still life around so that the dark objects are closer to the light.  The wrinkles in the upper corners &amp; reflection in the glasses are also a bit distracting.  I love how the glasses are upside down...adds to the "relaxed" feeling.</td>', 'Great coloring of the light (reminds me of neon lights in a bar more than a sunset)...however the fall off is rapid making the tanning oil and shoe (?) too dark.  I''d suggest using a stronger light, 2nd light, move the light to the other side, or swap your still life around so that the dark objects are closer to the light.  The wrinkles in the upper corners & reflection in the glasses are also a bit distracting.  I love how the glasses are upside down...adds to the "relaxed" feeling.', '2006-05-17 03:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
