(2425422, 335288, 32084, '<td valign="top">I like the photo very much, however I do not feel it is an appropriate still life.  gain though, well done.</td>', 'I like the photo very much, however I do not feel it is an appropriate still life.  gain though, well done.', '2006-05-17 13:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425436, 334707, 57202, '<td valign="top">Definitely like the theme.  Great minds think alike?... :)  The felt seems a bit dark to me though.  Also, I think it would have benefited more from a different angle.  An interesting angle almost always seems to look better than a top-down view.  What was the light source?  On-camera flash or maybe an overhead light?  I definitely like the shot, but would have shot at a different angle and brought more light into the picture.  Great idea though and excellent clarity on the cards. :D</td>', 'Definitely like the theme.  Great minds think alike?... :)  The felt seems a bit dark to me though.  Also, I think it would have benefited more from a different angle.  An interesting angle almost always seems to look better than a top-down view.  What was the light source?  On-camera flash or maybe an overhead light?  I definitely like the shot, but would have shot at a different angle and brought more light into the picture.  Great idea though and excellent clarity on the cards. :D', '2006-05-17 13:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425443, 334671, 16477, '<td valign="top">I hope it does well,10</td>', 'I hope it does well,10', '2006-05-17 13:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425448, 335455, 28710, '<td valign="top">I know that lots of people hate comments about titles, but I''m not voting based on it...<br/> <br/>I really like this title. It''s got a great dual meaning that makes the already attractive picture even more attractive.<br/> <br/>Still as in no movement, but still as in still around, and again lends to the repetition both in the drizzled wax and in the obvious cycle that a candle and holder goes through.<br/> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'I know that lots of people hate comments about titles, but I''m not voting based on it... I really like this title. It''s got a great dual meaning that makes the already attractive picture even more attractive. Still as in no movement, but still as in still around, and again lends to the repetition both in the drizzled wax and in the obvious cycle that a candle and holder goes through. Very nice.', '2006-05-17 13:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425465, 335596, 57202, '<td valign="top">If you wanted the food to be the focus of the picture, I would have put it on a non-distracting surface (large sheet of white paper?) and been close enough to fill the frame with it and get dead-on focus and detail.  I think the light bouncing off the foil is distracting.  All the space in the background (table and wall) both pull you away from your subject and the wine glass doesn''t seem to fit in quite right.  From what I have observed on DPC, it is always the simplest shots with the least distractions that score the best.  Best of luck.</td>', 'If you wanted the food to be the focus of the picture, I would have put it on a non-distracting surface (large sheet of white paper?) and been close enough to fill the frame with it and get dead-on focus and detail.  I think the light bouncing off the foil is distracting.  All the space in the background (table and wall) both pull you away from your subject and the wine glass doesn''t seem to fit in quite right.  From what I have observed on DPC, it is always the simplest shots with the least distractions that score the best.  Best of luck.', '2006-05-17 13:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425473, 335240, 57202, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!  Nice macro shot. :)  It would have popped a little more for me if the lime was a brighter (limier?) green though.</td>', 'Woohoo!  Nice macro shot. :)  It would have popped a little more for me if the lime was a brighter (limier?) green though.', '2006-05-17 13:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425477, 334168, 16477, '<td valign="top">Fits  my defination of still life  Photograph.9</td>', 'Fits  my defination of still life  Photograph.9', '2006-05-17 13:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425490, 335444, 16477, '<td valign="top">very still for me, 10</td>', 'very still for me, 10', '2006-05-17 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425491, 333702, 52352, '<td valign="top">nice picture, not still life</td>', 'nice picture, not still life', '2006-05-17 13:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425494, 333058, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this shot.  The pink flower in the back has a nice glow to it, but is still in focus.  I know it seems odd, but I think this would have been even better in my mind if the light was just a LITTLE brighter and if the ground was actually covered with a thin layer of soil.  Yeah, I know.  Like I said, I''m weird. ;)</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this shot.  The pink flower in the back has a nice glow to it, but is still in focus.  I know it seems odd, but I think this would have been even better in my mind if the light was just a LITTLE brighter and if the ground was actually covered with a thin layer of soil.  Yeah, I know.  Like I said, I''m weird. ;)', '2006-05-17 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425505, 335027, 57202, '<td valign="top">Excellent example of negative space.  However, in my mind, still life typically conjures up images of shots indoors of inanimate objects.  I do see how this might apply though and like that you used a short enough exposure to NOT capture movement of the stars.</td>', 'Excellent example of negative space.  However, in my mind, still life typically conjures up images of shots indoors of inanimate objects.  I do see how this might apply though and like that you used a short enough exposure to NOT capture movement of the stars.', '2006-05-17 13:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425508, 333749, 51750, '<td valign="top">wow that must''ve taken awhile</td>', 'wow that must''ve taken awhile', '2006-05-17 13:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
