(2425869, 334318, 50142, '<td valign="top">Flower shot - problem with a flower shot is that you will have hundreds of others to compete with (incl mine) and you need to make your photo stand out - do something diferent. I have exactly the same problem with mine - although a nice shot - like yours - there is nothing to make it stand out.</td>', 'Flower shot - problem with a flower shot is that you will have hundreds of others to compete with (incl mine) and you need to make your photo stand out - do something diferent. I have exactly the same problem with mine - although a nice shot - like yours - there is nothing to make it stand out.', '2006-05-17 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425870, 334432, 57839, '<td valign="top">Did not meet the challenge, IMO.</td>', 'Did not meet the challenge, IMO.', '2006-05-17 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425871, 335476, 57202, '<td valign="top">I feel that the focus could have been a bit sharper on that main flower.  Even with a large aperture, the edges should be a bit crisper.</td>', 'I feel that the focus could have been a bit sharper on that main flower.  Even with a large aperture, the edges should be a bit crisper.', '2006-05-17 15:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425872, 334678, 3102, '<td valign="top">Why would anyone want to see that...?</td>', 'Why would anyone want to see that...?', '2006-05-17 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425882, 332951, 50142, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the mood. Nice focus - light in the window is a bit distracting. Maybe a diferent angle to cut out the window would''ve helped.</td>', 'Love the colours and the mood. Nice focus - light in the window is a bit distracting. Maybe a diferent angle to cut out the window would''ve helped.', '2006-05-17 15:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425883, 333625, 57839, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge, IMO.  Good angle otherwise.</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge, IMO.  Good angle otherwise.', '2006-05-17 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425886, 335365, 57202, '<td valign="top">I feel the focus could have been a little bit sharper.</td>', 'I feel the focus could have been a little bit sharper.', '2006-05-17 15:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425888, 335368, 57839, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh.', '2006-05-17 15:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425893, 334758, 57202, '<td valign="top">I doubt that remains very still. ;)</td>', 'I doubt that remains very still. ;)', '2006-05-17 15:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425895, 335431, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the challenge... and one of the relatively few that actually seem to be a still life in the traditional sense.  I like the mood you created with the lighting, and the overall colors involved.  If I had a criticism to offer, it would be the shadown on the cheese from the wine glass, but I still like it well enough to give it a 10.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is my favorite of the challenge... and one of the relatively few that actually seem to be a still life in the traditional sense.  I like the mood you created with the lighting, and the overall colors involved.  If I had a criticism to offer, it would be the shadown on the cheese from the wine glass, but I still like it well enough to give it a 10.  Nice work!', '2006-05-17 15:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425896, 335463, 57839, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really meet the challenge, IMO.  The composition could be improved as well.</td>', 'Doesn''t really meet the challenge, IMO.  The composition could be improved as well.', '2006-05-17 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425897, 333414, 50142, '<td valign="top">Weird - don''t like the yellow stuff on the right - distracting - what is it?</td>', 'Weird - don''t like the yellow stuff on the right - distracting - what is it?', '2006-05-17 15:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425904, 335545, 57202, '<td valign="top">Very rich tones, I like it.</td>', 'Very rich tones, I like it.', '2006-05-17 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425905, 335499, 57839, '<td valign="top">Focus is lacking.  Composition is nice though.</td>', 'Focus is lacking.  Composition is nice though.', '2006-05-17 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425906, 333573, 57839, '<td valign="top">Technically a good shot.  Just not all that interesting.  :)</td>', 'Technically a good shot.  Just not all that interesting.  :)', '2006-05-17 15:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425911, 334610, 57839, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this meets the challenge.  Interesting shot &amp; caption though.</td>', 'I don''t think this meets the challenge.  Interesting shot & caption though.', '2006-05-17 15:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425919, 333257, 57839, '<td valign="top">Niece abstract but seems to lack focus or enough DOF.</td>', 'Niece abstract but seems to lack focus or enough DOF.', '2006-05-17 15:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425920, 334035, 57839, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft &amp; lighting could be improved.</td>', 'Focus is soft & lighting could be improved.', '2006-05-17 15:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425922, 335258, 51122, '<td valign="top">very attractive!</td>', 'very attractive!', '2006-05-17 15:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425923, 335262, 57202, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, but wish it had been in much sharper focus and that the highlights were a bit brighter.  Aside from the focus and lighting, I think it could have used a little levels adjsutment to help it pop.  Nice shot though. :)</td>', 'I love the composition, but wish it had been in much sharper focus and that the highlights were a bit brighter.  Aside from the focus and lighting, I think it could have used a little levels adjsutment to help it pop.  Nice shot though. :)', '2006-05-17 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425927, 334688, 57202, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus, excellent lighting, and appropriate title.  I like it. :)</td>', 'Sharp focus, excellent lighting, and appropriate title.  I like it. :)', '2006-05-17 15:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425928, 335240, 50142, '<td valign="top">Weird - not to my taste though. Can''t understand what it is.</td>', 'Weird - not to my taste though. Can''t understand what it is.', '2006-05-17 15:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425930, 332937, 57839, '<td valign="top">The background items distract.</td>', 'The background items distract.', '2006-05-17 15:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425932, 334690, 3102, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  Simple and elegant.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  Simple and elegant.', '2006-05-17 15:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425937, 334678, 51122, '<td valign="top">nice subject :P</td>', 'nice subject :P', '2006-05-17 15:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425938, 333749, 49814, '<td valign="top">This one is the winner! Great colors, very creative concept, well composed. A little work in post and it will be a WOW!</td>', 'This one is the winner! Great colors, very creative concept, well composed. A little work in post and it will be a WOW!', '2006-05-17 15:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425939, 334311, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, pleasing colors and good depth of field.  A 9 from me.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, pleasing colors and good depth of field.  A 9 from me.', '2006-05-17 15:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425941, 335318, 57202, '<td valign="top">I love the subject matter.  I think it could "pop" a bit more though (levels adjustment, maybe?).</td>', 'I love the subject matter.  I think it could "pop" a bit more though (levels adjustment, maybe?).', '2006-05-17 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425944, 334536, 49814, '<td valign="top">Very cool, How did you get the reflection so perfect?</td>', 'Very cool, How did you get the reflection so perfect?', '2006-05-17 15:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425945, 334688, 3102, '<td valign="top">You''ve succeeded in making me hungry!  I like the way the colors match up in this one.  Nice and sharp, too.  Good work!</td>', 'You''ve succeeded in making me hungry!  I like the way the colors match up in this one.  Nice and sharp, too.  Good work!', '2006-05-17 15:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425948, 333749, 51122, '<td valign="top">wow lot of time went into this, and it worked. very nice, something else!</td>', 'wow lot of time went into this, and it worked. very nice, something else!', '2006-05-17 15:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425949, 334814, 43203, '<td valign="top">I love it.10</td>', 'I love it.10', '2006-05-17 15:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425952, 335324, 3102, '<td valign="top">Simple and very tastefully done.  It''s a nice reminder of a simplier time.  Excellent work!</td>', 'Simple and very tastefully done.  It''s a nice reminder of a simplier time.  Excellent work!', '2006-05-17 15:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425957, 334633, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting with this one.  I know how hard it is to get lighting to look right when it''s reflected off bottles and glasses like that.  You pulled it off very nicely.</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting with this one.  I know how hard it is to get lighting to look right when it''s reflected off bottles and glasses like that.  You pulled it off very nicely.', '2006-05-17 15:13:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2425958, 335322, 49814, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot. Would have prefered a lower angle to lengthen the diamond shape and maybe a key light to bring out the color in the port.</td>', 'Like it a lot. Would have prefered a lower angle to lengthen the diamond shape and maybe a key light to bring out the color in the port.', '2006-05-17 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425963, 335175, 43203, '<td valign="top">A fine image of two of my loves.10</td>', 'A fine image of two of my loves.10', '2006-05-17 15:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425967, 335056, 57202, '<td valign="top">WOnderful shot. :)  That web really stands out against the background.</td>', 'WOnderful shot. :)  That web really stands out against the background.', '2006-05-17 15:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425972, 333252, 49814, '<td valign="top">Very good. IMO, the composition is not quite right... Would like to see the other arrangements</td>', 'Very good. IMO, the composition is not quite right... Would like to see the other arrangements', '2006-05-17 15:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425974, 335483, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely set up!  I''ll bet you have one of those immaculate houses where everything is always nice and tidy, and all of the towels match, etc., etc. :)  I''m saying that as a compliment, by the way... I''m sure I''ll never live in an environment like that!</td>', 'Very nicely set up!  I''ll bet you have one of those immaculate houses where everything is always nice and tidy, and all of the towels match, etc., etc. :)  I''m saying that as a compliment, by the way... I''m sure I''ll never live in an environment like that!', '2006-05-17 15:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425975, 334981, 51122, '<td valign="top">nice, ill buy one!</td>', 'nice, ill buy one!', '2006-05-17 15:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425977, 335381, 49814, '<td valign="top">Very good concept. Lighting is a little harsh and the camera angle doesnt add to the compostion.</td>', 'Very good concept. Lighting is a little harsh and the camera angle doesnt add to the compostion.', '2006-05-17 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425978, 335302, 50142, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W r7</td>', 'Nice B&W r7', '2006-05-17 15:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425983, 333836, 3102, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t strike me as a still life, and even putting that aside, it doesn''t have a whole lot of appeal photographically, considering the harsh lighting.</td>', 'Doesn''t strike me as a still life, and even putting that aside, it doesn''t have a whole lot of appeal photographically, considering the harsh lighting.', '2006-05-17 15:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425984, 335430, 51122, '<td valign="top">love the sparcles in the...sugar?</td>', 'love the sparcles in the...sugar?', '2006-05-17 15:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425985, 334168, 49814, '<td valign="top">Simple and well fit for a still life. A little over exposed though</td>', 'Simple and well fit for a still life. A little over exposed though', '2006-05-17 15:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425987, 335345, 51122, '<td valign="top">very nice idea...</td>', 'very nice idea...', '2006-05-17 15:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425989, 333812, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not really what I think of when I think of a still life, in all honesty.  This would probably fit better in a photojournalism or social commentary type of category.</td>', 'Not really what I think of when I think of a still life, in all honesty.  This would probably fit better in a photojournalism or social commentary type of category.', '2006-05-17 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2425999, 334761, 49814, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. A tad dark IMO. A common suject too</td>', 'Wonderful. A tad dark IMO. A common suject too', '2006-05-17 15:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426004, 334762, 3102, '<td valign="top">A somewhat interesting subject, but I can''t say I''m sold on the composition.</td>', 'A somewhat interesting subject, but I can''t say I''m sold on the composition.', '2006-05-17 15:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426007, 335554, 57839, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I do not feel this meets the challenge.  Nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'Sorry, I do not feel this meets the challenge.  Nice shot otherwise.', '2006-05-17 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426010, 334035, 57202, '<td valign="top">The colors in this seem washed out.  Try using a threshhold adjustment layer in Photoshop to color-correct.  Or maybe even some simple levels adjustments.</td>', 'The colors in this seem washed out.  Try using a threshhold adjustment layer in Photoshop to color-correct.  Or maybe even some simple levels adjustments.', '2006-05-17 15:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426013, 335322, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nice arrangement... I like the symmetry here.  I guess my only criticism is the awkward reflections in the bottom.  I gave it a 9.</td>', 'A nice arrangement... I like the symmetry here.  I guess my only criticism is the awkward reflections in the bottom.  I gave it a 9.', '2006-05-17 15:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
