(2426258, 334680, 53964, '<td valign="top">Interesting.... but I just don''t like the apple. I like the way the other disparate elements are drawn together by their tones, but the apple doesn''t tie in in any way that I see. If it''s meant as a contrast, to stand out, it''s not vivid/different enough to quite succeed. I really like the lighting and composition, the leading lines, just not that one little thing.</td>', 'Interesting.... but I just don''t like the apple. I like the way the other disparate elements are drawn together by their tones, but the apple doesn''t tie in in any way that I see. If it''s meant as a contrast, to stand out, it''s not vivid/different enough to quite succeed. I really like the lighting and composition, the leading lines, just not that one little thing.', '2006-05-17 15:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
