(2426375, 335375, 58889, '<td valign="top">lol! very funy :)</td>', 'lol! very funy :)', '2006-05-17 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426378, 335463, 53964, '<td valign="top">A still life generally brings together a number of elements arranged by the artist into an eyecatching grouping. Ignoring that and considering the photo, it''s an interesting subject but could be made more striking by increasing contrast. I''d suggest cropping tighter left, both to remove the extraneous bush and to bring the subject out of center, giving more illusion of flight toward the edge of the frame.  Maybe check out info on the rule of thirds.   Hope this helps :)</td>', 'A still life generally brings together a number of elements arranged by the artist into an eyecatching grouping. Ignoring that and considering the photo, it''s an interesting subject but could be made more striking by increasing contrast. I''d suggest cropping tighter left, both to remove the extraneous bush and to bring the subject out of center, giving more illusion of flight toward the edge of the frame.  Maybe check out info on the rule of thirds.   Hope this helps :)', '2006-05-17 16:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426386, 335054, 53964, '<td valign="top">I love the shadows, but the overall shot is stiff somehow. I dunno, maybe shooting from a bit lower angle, distorting the guitars a bit the way the shadows do? I''m not sure just what it is, something''s just not spot-on, to my eye. Sorry I can''t be more helpful.</td>', 'I love the shadows, but the overall shot is stiff somehow. I dunno, maybe shooting from a bit lower angle, distorting the guitars a bit the way the shadows do? I''m not sure just what it is, something''s just not spot-on, to my eye. Sorry I can''t be more helpful.', '2006-05-17 16:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426408, 333573, 53964, '<td valign="top">Technically a still life, technically well done, just not very interesting.</td>', 'Technically a still life, technically well done, just not very interesting.', '2006-05-17 16:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426409, 333665, 58889, '<td valign="top">the main image is well seen and photographed - i would have taken away the coffee cup.  It makes the image too busy and distracts from the main focus</td>', 'the main image is well seen and photographed - i would have taken away the coffee cup.  It makes the image too busy and distracts from the main focus', '2006-05-17 16:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426414, 335176, 53964, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very weak, giving no sharpness anywhere.</td>', 'Lighting is very weak, giving no sharpness anywhere.', '2006-05-17 16:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426428, 335052, 53964, '<td valign="top">Was going to comment on the right-side crop tightness, then guessed by the tiny sliver on the bottom that you had to rotate and had to crop more than you planned. I always try to give myself a bit of extra space in case of that.  (I''m notorious for taking tilted horizons). Otherwise I love this and am rating it in my higher group.</td>', 'Was going to comment on the right-side crop tightness, then guessed by the tiny sliver on the bottom that you had to rotate and had to crop more than you planned. I always try to give myself a bit of extra space in case of that.  (I''m notorious for taking tilted horizons). Otherwise I love this and am rating it in my higher group.', '2006-05-17 16:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2426434, 334085, 53964, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Inverting this has brought the shadows into being part of the main element.</td>', 'Very creative. Inverting this has brought the shadows into being part of the main element.', '2006-05-17 16:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
