(2426940, 335376, 55414, '<td valign="top">The image looks a little hot (direct flashish)  I''d suggest using a defuser of some sort on the flash, multiple flashes if you can or, in the case of an on-camera flash (depending on the camera you have), a piece of printer paper in front of the flash to defuse it. A defuser(s) will provide a softer light and bring out more tones.  Good framing.</td>', 'The image looks a little hot (direct flashish)  I''d suggest using a defuser of some sort on the flash, multiple flashes if you can or, in the case of an on-camera flash (depending on the camera you have), a piece of printer paper in front of the flash to defuse it. A defuser(s) will provide a softer light and bring out more tones.  Good framing.', '2006-05-17 19:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
