(2427354, 332951, 18197, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it. Nevertheless, it is a lovely photo, one you should be proud of.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it. Nevertheless, it is a lovely photo, one you should be proud of.', '2006-05-17 21:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
