(2427362, 333485, 18197, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it. Further, the image is very small. I would suggest submitting photos that fully utilize the available pixels so we can see the photo better.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it. Further, the image is very small. I would suggest submitting photos that fully utilize the available pixels so we can see the photo better.', '2006-05-17 21:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
