(2427609, 335368, 55199, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm :)  yummy.  Not sure I like the composition though.</td>', 'Mmmmm :)  yummy.  Not sure I like the composition though.', '2006-05-17 22:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427615, 335573, 55199, '<td valign="top">LOL... funny!  :D</td>', 'LOL... funny!  :D', '2006-05-17 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427637, 334633, 55199, '<td valign="top">Too bad your back drop is wrinkly.</td>', 'Too bad your back drop is wrinkly.', '2006-05-17 22:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427652, 335430, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like this. The lighting really draws you in. <br/> <br/>What I think could have made this better would be a tighter crop and a wider DOF. The sugar pile is the main issue for me really. I would have preferred that to be in focus and as sharp as everything else. Good image though. Good luck!</td>', 'I like this. The lighting really draws you in.  What I think could have made this better would be a tighter crop and a wider DOF. The sugar pile is the main issue for me really. I would have preferred that to be in focus and as sharp as everything else. Good image though. Good luck!', '2006-05-17 22:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427654, 335322, 55199, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative.  I think a contrasting ''background'' might make this even better... maybe a soft orange color?</td>', 'Interesting and creative.  I think a contrasting ''background'' might make this even better... maybe a soft orange color?', '2006-05-17 22:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427659, 334595, 55199, '<td valign="top">Simple and thought provoking. :)</td>', 'Simple and thought provoking. :)', '2006-05-17 22:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427669, 333588, 41337, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny. I almost didn''t even see the handcuffs. You crazy. :P</td>', 'Pretty funny. I almost didn''t even see the handcuffs. You crazy. :P', '2006-05-17 22:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427682, 334304, 55199, '<td valign="top">This could be interesting if you play with it some more (perhaps cover the rack with a blanket under the saddle, and add something leaning against the saddle) and if you improve the focus.</td>', 'This could be interesting if you play with it some more (perhaps cover the rack with a blanket under the saddle, and add something leaning against the saddle) and if you improve the focus.', '2006-05-17 22:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427684, 334818, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The tonal range is perfect. My only nitpick is that rouge bean on the left border. :)</td>', 'Nice composition. The tonal range is perfect. My only nitpick is that rouge bean on the left border. :)', '2006-05-17 22:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427694, 335236, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the color combination.  However, the highlights are a little blown and the color might be a wee bit too saturated.</td>', 'I like the composition and the color combination.  However, the highlights are a little blown and the color might be a wee bit too saturated.', '2006-05-17 22:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427710, 334678, 41337, '<td valign="top">You must want the brown ribbon badly. :P</td>', 'You must want the brown ribbon badly. :P', '2006-05-17 23:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427714, 335175, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color.  Interesting flies!  I think this one will do well.</td>', 'Nice composition and color.  Interesting flies!  I think this one will do well.', '2006-05-17 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427751, 334990, 57839, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Unfortunately, I don''t know that it meets the challenge (or my interpretation anyway).</td>', 'I like this shot.  Unfortunately, I don''t know that it meets the challenge (or my interpretation anyway).', '2006-05-17 23:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427753, 333252, 55199, '<td valign="top">Cool beans!</td>', 'Cool beans!', '2006-05-17 23:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427756, 335297, 57839, '<td valign="top">I really, really love this shot.  Composition is most excellent.  But... I don''t think it meets the challenge (or at least my interpretation of still life).</td>', 'I really, really love this shot.  Composition is most excellent.  But... I don''t think it meets the challenge (or at least my interpretation of still life).', '2006-05-17 23:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427788, 334982, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the rose and the rocks, too bad the lighting on the flower isn''t softer.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the rose and the rocks, too bad the lighting on the flower isn''t softer.', '2006-05-17 23:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427792, 335395, 18197, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it. That being said, it is a very pleasing image.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it. That being said, it is a very pleasing image.', '2006-05-17 23:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427802, 334814, 18197, '<td valign="top">I may be the only one but i''m just not resonating with the subject. And it is clearly not a still life in the classic form. Poor subject choice + Off challenge + Reasonably well executed = 1 from me. Sorry.</td>', 'I may be the only one but i''m just not resonating with the subject. And it is clearly not a still life in the classic form. Poor subject choice + Off challenge + Reasonably well executed = 1 from me. Sorry.', '2006-05-17 23:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427805, 333665, 18197, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it.', '2006-05-17 23:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427816, 335461, 51125, '<td valign="top">Love the high key lighting.</td>', 'Love the high key lighting.', '2006-05-17 23:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427818, 335175, 51125, '<td valign="top">Outstanding color and composition.</td>', 'Outstanding color and composition.', '2006-05-17 23:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427824, 333820, 51125, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and great light make a powerful combination.  A little more sharpening would blow this out of the water!</td>', 'Clever idea and great light make a powerful combination.  A little more sharpening would blow this out of the water!', '2006-05-17 23:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427825, 334289, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and the doutone works nice too.  I like that the thread looks tangled it adds even more interest.  Good job! :)</td>', 'Nice composition and the doutone works nice too.  I like that the thread looks tangled it adds even more interest.  Good job! :)', '2006-05-17 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427826, 334763, 18197, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it. But all that aside, the hot spot above is distracting. The image is small; making it bigger might have provided more details.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 1 because it didn''t seem to me to fulfill my expectation of a "still life," a classic form of artfully arranged objects. Call me narrow minded but that''s the way I see it. But all that aside, the hot spot above is distracting. The image is small; making it bigger might have provided more details.', '2006-05-17 23:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427830, 335582, 51125, '<td valign="top">Very painterly.</td>', 'Very painterly.', '2006-05-17 23:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427834, 334739, 51125, '<td valign="top">Great high key shot!</td>', 'Great high key shot!', '2006-05-17 23:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427842, 335448, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I especially like the lighting effect.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I especially like the lighting effect.', '2006-05-17 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427847, 333312, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s an interesting image. I like the up, down, up nature of it. I suppose it could be classified as surrealist, but I''m not getting the still life connection, certainly not in the classic form.</td>', 'Well, it''s an interesting image. I like the up, down, up nature of it. I suppose it could be classified as surrealist, but I''m not getting the still life connection, certainly not in the classic form.', '2006-05-17 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427848, 334020, 51125, '<td valign="top">I think everything should be in focus here.</td>', 'I think everything should be in focus here.', '2006-05-17 23:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2427853, 334818, 47575, '<td valign="top">I hate coffee but I love this picture! 10</td>', 'I hate coffee but I love this picture! 10', '2006-05-17 23:30:30.000000', NULL, 1);
