(2429332, 335362, 15711, '<td valign="top">Definitely a still life - as many in this challenge are not.  I think the crop is  a bit too tight. I''d like to have the wine/glass less centered with more negative space around it.  I think the graininess might suit it better, if the glass and bottle were old. But having said that, the focus and composition is good. Still giving pretty high marks as you "got it" and many did not. LOL 7</td>', 'Definitely a still life - as many in this challenge are not.  I think the crop is  a bit too tight. I''d like to have the wine/glass less centered with more negative space around it.  I think the graininess might suit it better, if the glass and bottle were old. But having said that, the focus and composition is good. Still giving pretty high marks as you "got it" and many did not. LOL 7', '2006-05-18 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
