(2429335, 334764, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great advertising type shot but this isn''t a still life. A still life is a collection of things and a single object puts it in a totally different category. The clarity and focus is perfect but... not for this challenge.</td>', 'Great advertising type shot but this isn''t a still life. A still life is a collection of things and a single object puts it in a totally different category. The clarity and focus is perfect but... not for this challenge.', '2006-05-18 09:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429341, 333055, 56828, '<td valign="top">Good shot and idea.  If your focus was on the music book you should have more of an angle of viewing the book.  If not more focus should have been on the wine.  Right now it''s hard to determine where you focus is.</td>', 'Good shot and idea.  If your focus was on the music book you should have more of an angle of viewing the book.  If not more focus should have been on the wine.  Right now it''s hard to determine where you focus is.', '2006-05-18 09:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429343, 333477, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the different non-traditional interpretation (no fruit, glass, flowers on a table) you chose to use, but I feel as if they are slightly out of focus.  The use of negative space is good, and the collection is well done - I even like the reflection.  But I wish it was tack sharp.  Having said that, at least your image meets the challenge, as more than half do not.</td>', 'I like the different non-traditional interpretation (no fruit, glass, flowers on a table) you chose to use, but I feel as if they are slightly out of focus.  The use of negative space is good, and the collection is well done - I even like the reflection.  But I wish it was tack sharp.  Having said that, at least your image meets the challenge, as more than half do not.', '2006-05-18 09:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429345, 335322, 56828, '<td valign="top">novel idea.</td>', 'novel idea.', '2006-05-18 09:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429348, 334633, 57229, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Needs to straighten up and fly right. Stylistically consistent. 6</td>', 'This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Needs to straighten up and fly right. Stylistically consistent. 6', '2006-05-18 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429349, 333736, 15711, '<td valign="top">Different interpretation but this is still life, just not in the wine bottle, fruit basket sense.  Something leaves me wanting more.  Maybe it''s the tightness of the crop.  Yet, if these were just sitting there with lots of negative space, it might not work either.  The focus is good.  I think just for "getting it", I''ll give you a 7.</td>', 'Different interpretation but this is still life, just not in the wine bottle, fruit basket sense.  Something leaves me wanting more.  Maybe it''s the tightness of the crop.  Yet, if these were just sitting there with lots of negative space, it might not work either.  The focus is good.  I think just for "getting it", I''ll give you a 7.', '2006-05-18 09:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429352, 334178, 15711, '<td valign="top">This suits the challenge, but kind of leaves me blah. I think the diminished tones could be part of it. It kind of has a washed out feeling. The majority of the objects seem to be "leaving the frame" too. I think if they were perhaps more artfull placed and the lighting were better, it would help considerably. But having said that, at least this meets the challenge, as so many do not. 6</td>', 'This suits the challenge, but kind of leaves me blah. I think the diminished tones could be part of it. It kind of has a washed out feeling. The majority of the objects seem to be "leaving the frame" too. I think if they were perhaps more artfull placed and the lighting were better, it would help considerably. But having said that, at least this meets the challenge, as so many do not. 6', '2006-05-18 09:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429354, 332544, 56828, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this quite meets the challenge.  Birds flying and water flowing water aren''t considered still life.</td>', 'I don''t think this quite meets the challenge.  Birds flying and water flowing water aren''t considered still life.', '2006-05-18 09:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429355, 335318, 57229, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. I''d have liked to see the lighting less flat, probably the clours less saturated, and more (apparent) effect of the candle flames on the ambient lighting. 6</td>', 'This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. I''d have liked to see the lighting less flat, probably the clours less saturated, and more (apparent) effect of the candle flames on the ambient lighting. 6', '2006-05-18 09:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429357, 335342, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract sens of it. Almost like they are floating in a grid.  I''m trying to figure out what the lines are to the lower right.  THey don''t bother me, I just don''t know what they are.  Different interpretaiton of the challenge - nice originality. 7</td>', 'I like the abstract sens of it. Almost like they are floating in a grid.  I''m trying to figure out what the lines are to the lower right.  THey don''t bother me, I just don''t know what they are.  Different interpretaiton of the challenge - nice originality. 7', '2006-05-18 09:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429358, 334937, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.</td>', 'Great DOF.', '2006-05-18 09:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429366, 335363, 15711, '<td valign="top">If these were artfully placed on a solid background with great lighting you''d really have something. As it is, it just appears to be a shelf with some stuff on it.  Not meaning to be harsh, but a still life is a grouping that are artfully placed by the artist. At least you got the "group of inanimate objects," which many did not. LOL</td>', 'If these were artfully placed on a solid background with great lighting you''d really have something. As it is, it just appears to be a shelf with some stuff on it.  Not meaning to be harsh, but a still life is a grouping that are artfully placed by the artist. At least you got the "group of inanimate objects," which many did not. LOL', '2006-05-18 10:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429368, 335520, 56828, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  The only problem i see is that all your lighting equipment is visible in the reflection off the pitcher.</td>', 'Good photo.  The only problem i see is that all your lighting equipment is visible in the reflection off the pitcher.', '2006-05-18 10:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429369, 335052, 57229, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Quite classic and simple. Either the white balance or the colour saturation might be adjusted to get things more real and less plastic. You could tilt the basket, too - it hides too much. 6</td>', 'This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Quite classic and simple. Either the white balance or the colour saturation might be adjusted to get things more real and less plastic. You could tilt the basket, too - it hides too much. 6', '2006-05-18 10:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429371, 335056, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting but to me does not make a still life. I love the clarity and the contrast, but a true still life is a collection of items grouped by the artist, whereas this is something found in nature and you had nothing to do with its placement.  If it were just an image to rate on it''s own, I''d probaby give it a 7, but not meeting challenge, hurts it for me. I hope you find this helpful. ;~D</td>', 'This is interesting but to me does not make a still life. I love the clarity and the contrast, but a true still life is a collection of items grouped by the artist, whereas this is something found in nature and you had nothing to do with its placement.  If it were just an image to rate on it''s own, I''d probaby give it a 7, but not meeting challenge, hurts it for me. I hope you find this helpful. ;~D', '2006-05-18 10:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429375, 333726, 56828, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe moving boats and river/sea/ocean water count as still life.</td>', 'I don''t believe moving boats and river/sea/ocean water count as still life.', '2006-05-18 10:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429378, 335386, 56828, '<td valign="top">A darker background could have made this photo better.  It''s too bright a white.</td>', 'A darker background could have made this photo better.  It''s too bright a white.', '2006-05-18 10:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429379, 335262, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a still life of sorts, but the blur really ruins its artfulness. Tack sharp focus is essential for an image like this to work.<br/> <br/>Oh by the way, congrats to the grad.</td>', 'This is a still life of sorts, but the blur really ruins its artfulness. Tack sharp focus is essential for an image like this to work. Oh by the way, congrats to the grad.', '2006-05-18 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429380, 334190, 2022, '<td valign="top">Pure and simple, well done (10)</td>', 'Pure and simple, well done (10)', '2006-05-18 10:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429381, 335254, 2022, '<td valign="top">Nice (9)</td>', 'Nice (9)', '2006-05-18 10:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429382, 334274, 57229, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. I''d back off some of that colour saturation to make it look more like real fruit. 7</td>', 'This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. I''d back off some of that colour saturation to make it look more like real fruit. 7', '2006-05-18 10:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429383, 334039, 56828, '<td valign="top">The photo is pretty confusing as to what your subject is.</td>', 'The photo is pretty confusing as to what your subject is.', '2006-05-18 10:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429384, 332711, 57229, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Effective. 7</td>', 'This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Effective. 7', '2006-05-18 10:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429385, 334513, 56828, '<td valign="top">This is probably the best photo I''ve seen in this challenge so far.  Great shot, perfect focus and unique.</td>', 'This is probably the best photo I''ve seen in this challenge so far.  Great shot, perfect focus and unique.', '2006-05-18 10:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429386, 335499, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think for this to really work, it has to be artfully placed objects. They seem to just be already there, with an image made of them. The lighting is a bit too harsh and the focus isn''t quite tack sharp. At least it is a group of inanimate objects, which half of the entries are not.</td>', 'I think for this to really work, it has to be artfully placed objects. They seem to just be already there, with an image made of them. The lighting is a bit too harsh and the focus isn''t quite tack sharp. At least it is a group of inanimate objects, which half of the entries are not.', '2006-05-18 10:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429387, 335534, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great angle on the shot.</td>', 'Great angle on the shot.', '2006-05-18 10:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429388, 335342, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great use of color and reflections.</td>', 'Great use of color and reflections.', '2006-05-18 10:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429391, 334020, 57229, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. I like the picture but not so much the still life. The composition is about the theme more than about the visual qualities of the elements and their juxtaposition. 6</td>', 'This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. I like the picture but not so much the still life. The composition is about the theme more than about the visual qualities of the elements and their juxtaposition. 6', '2006-05-18 10:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429392, 334785, 15711, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this, but it isn''t a still life. A still life is a group of inanimate objects artfully placed by the artist.  This is just a mesh bench. I wish this wasn''t entered in this challenge because its minimalism is great and I love the contrast.</td>', 'I absolutely love this, but it isn''t a still life. A still life is a group of inanimate objects artfully placed by the artist.  This is just a mesh bench. I wish this wasn''t entered in this challenge because its minimalism is great and I love the contrast.', '2006-05-18 10:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429394, 333749, 2022, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I am ambivalent though about the pink background. (7)</td>', 'Great idea, I am ambivalent though about the pink background. (7)', '2006-05-18 10:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429398, 335293, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. I like the window reflected in the blue glass. I think if there were something small in the lower right area, it would really finish it off for me. Having said that, at least you "got it" and this truly is a still life. Good luck!! 7</td>', 'Nice lighting. I like the window reflected in the blue glass. I think if there were something small in the lower right area, it would really finish it off for me. Having said that, at least you "got it" and this truly is a still life. Good luck!! 7', '2006-05-18 10:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429400, 334048, 56828, '<td valign="top">This photo looks like you took a subject that is normally a artists subject and made it real.  It''s the still life we were all initially taught and bought to life.  Great photo.</td>', 'This photo looks like you took a subject that is normally a artists subject and made it real.  It''s the still life we were all initially taught and bought to life.  Great photo.', '2006-05-18 10:07:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2429401, 334624, 56828, '<td valign="top">nice use of shadows.</td>', 'nice use of shadows.', '2006-05-18 10:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429402, 334916, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice tone and mood given to the photo.  Got a high score from me.  If the statue was turned around would have gotten a higher score.</td>', 'Great shot, nice tone and mood given to the photo.  Got a high score from me.  If the statue was turned around would have gotten a higher score.', '2006-05-18 10:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429404, 335472, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice setting up the mood.</td>', 'Nice setting up the mood.', '2006-05-18 10:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429405, 335588, 56828, '<td valign="top">The background coloring adds a great touch to this photo.  It as a great blend of yellows and reds.</td>', 'The background coloring adds a great touch to this photo.  It as a great blend of yellows and reds.', '2006-05-18 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429407, 334560, 57229, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Nice minimal idea. I think less colour saturation, or maybe adjusting the USM, could alleviate the wood/wax look of the apple. 6</td>', 'This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Nice minimal idea. I think less colour saturation, or maybe adjusting the USM, could alleviate the wood/wax look of the apple. 6', '2006-05-18 10:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429408, 334981, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great photo...would have been better if the bottle was empty or half empty.</td>', 'Great photo...would have been better if the bottle was empty or half empty.', '2006-05-18 10:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429409, 335295, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great details in this close up shot.</td>', 'Great details in this close up shot.', '2006-05-18 10:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429410, 335307, 56828, '<td valign="top">The blue adds a great mood to this photo</td>', 'The blue adds a great mood to this photo', '2006-05-18 10:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429412, 335559, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice tone to the photo.  It has great color clarity.  That and it has two of my favorite items...makers Mark and poker.</td>', 'Nice tone to the photo.  It has great color clarity.  That and it has two of my favorite items...makers Mark and poker.', '2006-05-18 10:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429413, 334030, 57229, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Tee hee. Nice browns. 6</td>', 'This meets the challenge  its inanimate and arranged. Tee hee. Nice browns. 6', '2006-05-18 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429418, 334077, 56828, '<td valign="top">nice use of geometry and interpretation.  (the title is what clued me in)</td>', 'nice use of geometry and interpretation.  (the title is what clued me in)', '2006-05-18 10:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429421, 333468, 56828, '<td valign="top">nice and unique.</td>', 'nice and unique.', '2006-05-18 10:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429422, 333861, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice tone to this shot. Not sure how the red bull fits in, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice tone to this shot. Not sure how the red bull fits in, but still a nice shot.', '2006-05-18 10:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429423, 333643, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great use of colors</td>', 'Great use of colors', '2006-05-18 10:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429424, 335594, 56828, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of lighting</td>', 'Very nice use of lighting', '2006-05-18 10:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429427, 335525, 56828, '<td valign="top">nice set up and uniqueness.</td>', 'nice set up and uniqueness.', '2006-05-18 10:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429429, 335434, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2006-05-18 10:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429430, 335465, 56828, '<td valign="top">The candle sets a great mood for this photo.</td>', 'The candle sets a great mood for this photo.', '2006-05-18 10:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429434, 335430, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is artfully done, and certainly suits the definition of still life. I''m wishing the surface were solid and not woodgrain. The lighting is good. I feel as if it has a touch of "chopped off" sense in the foreground. I wish the coffee items were pushed back with a bit more negative space in front of them.  Still, it DOES meet the challenge which is something I can''t say about more than half of them. LOL 7</td>', 'This is artfully done, and certainly suits the definition of still life. I''m wishing the surface were solid and not woodgrain. The lighting is good. I feel as if it has a touch of "chopped off" sense in the foreground. I wish the coffee items were pushed back with a bit more negative space in front of them.  Still, it DOES meet the challenge which is something I can''t say about more than half of them. LOL 7', '2006-05-18 10:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429436, 335444, 15711, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this.  I don''t think of it as still life in the traditional sense, but the focus, texture, and lighting are spot on. Looks like the cover of a country or agricultural magazine.  Nice job. 9</td>', 'I REALLY like this.  I don''t think of it as still life in the traditional sense, but the focus, texture, and lighting are spot on. Looks like the cover of a country or agricultural magazine.  Nice job. 9', '2006-05-18 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429439, 333854, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro, but not a still life. It needs to be a group of artfully placed objects. Lots of people didn''t understand the concept, so don''t feel alone.</td>', 'Beautiful macro, but not a still life. It needs to be a group of artfully placed objects. Lots of people didn''t understand the concept, so don''t feel alone.', '2006-05-18 10:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429442, 334690, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  I think what hurts it is the wrinkled backdrop and the wood texture of the table. I like the reflection in the bottle. At least you "got it." Many did not.</td>', 'Great lighting.  I think what hurts it is the wrinkled backdrop and the wood texture of the table. I like the reflection in the bottle. At least you "got it." Many did not.', '2006-05-18 10:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429444, 335302, 15711, '<td valign="top">The stark contrast is good.  Ther busy pattern of the surface is a bit distracting. I think I''d like to have the glass not "chopped off" by the square plates. At least you "got it" and this is a true still life.</td>', 'The stark contrast is good.  Ther busy pattern of the surface is a bit distracting. I think I''d like to have the glass not "chopped off" by the square plates. At least you "got it" and this is a true still life.', '2006-05-18 10:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429446, 333312, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m cracking up.  Funny interpretation of the challenge. ha ha ha Barbie - she''s always smiling isn''t she? ROFL</td>', 'I''m cracking up.  Funny interpretation of the challenge. ha ha ha Barbie - she''s always smiling isn''t she? ROFL', '2006-05-18 10:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429448, 335555, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Love the lighting.  THe texture of the vase adds to it for me with that touch of pattern and contrasting color. Looks like a poster.</td>', 'Pretty. Love the lighting.  THe texture of the vase adds to it for me with that touch of pattern and contrasting color. Looks like a poster.', '2006-05-18 10:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429453, 334916, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful but not a still life.  You need artfully placed inanimate objects. These are inanimate, but found already existing in an architectural setting.  If I were giving it points just for it''s own merit, it would be 7 or 8 but it doesn''t meet this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful but not a still life.  You need artfully placed inanimate objects. These are inanimate, but found already existing in an architectural setting.  If I were giving it points just for it''s own merit, it would be 7 or 8 but it doesn''t meet this challenge.', '2006-05-18 10:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429456, 333749, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the pink ... hmmmm  Really interesting though. I like the abstractness of it. Good imagination. 7</td>', 'Not sure about the pink ... hmmmm  Really interesting though. I like the abstractness of it. Good imagination. 7', '2006-05-18 10:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429458, 335445, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is simply stunning but not a still life. You need a group of items. <br/> <br/>God, the lighting and the focus is perfect... just not for this challenge.</td>', 'This is simply stunning but not a still life. You need a group of items.  God, the lighting and the focus is perfect... just not for this challenge.', '2006-05-18 10:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429461, 334190, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice tack sharp focus. I like the light reflecting off of the pepper. I''d like it a tad less centered, but other than that - spot on.</td>', 'Nice tack sharp focus. I like the light reflecting off of the pepper. I''d like it a tad less centered, but other than that - spot on.', '2006-05-18 10:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2429464, 333573, 49109, '<td valign="top">not really a still life, but a product shot. As that mediocre due to flat lighting and centered comp.</td>', 'not really a still life, but a product shot. As that mediocre due to flat lighting and centered comp.', '2006-05-18 10:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
