(2430704, 335521, 46819, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, DOF, reflections, and brightness/colour. Improvements: A cleaner surface on which the peppers are sitting upon, and perhaps something to give the peppers a bit more detail, possibly some moisture on them to bring out the texture. 7</td>', 'Nice colours, DOF, reflections, and brightness/colour. Improvements: A cleaner surface on which the peppers are sitting upon, and perhaps something to give the peppers a bit more detail, possibly some moisture on them to bring out the texture. 7', '2006-05-18 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430709, 334585, 43565, '<td valign="top">DNMC-no use of arranged inanimate objects.<br/> <br/>There is not enough context in this photo to tell me anything about life in Tepoztlan, except maybe it is boring and there is nothing to do.  Perhaps if you were also kneeling it would help.  I find the blue overwhelming.</td>', 'DNMC-no use of arranged inanimate objects. There is not enough context in this photo to tell me anything about life in Tepoztlan, except maybe it is boring and there is nothing to do.  Perhaps if you were also kneeling it would help.  I find the blue overwhelming.', '2006-05-18 15:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430710, 334513, 46819, '<td valign="top">I''d be very suprised if this one didn''t win. The colour and lighting of the scene is excellent with great depth of field. But above all that, the reflections are the piece de resistance. The only tiny, slightly annoying thing is the really small droplet that is to the left of the reflection of the picture in the glass. Almost unavaoidable though so I''ll give you a nice round 10!</td>', 'I''d be very suprised if this one didn''t win. The colour and lighting of the scene is excellent with great depth of field. But above all that, the reflections are the piece de resistance. The only tiny, slightly annoying thing is the really small droplet that is to the left of the reflection of the picture in the glass. Almost unavaoidable though so I''ll give you a nice round 10!', '2006-05-18 15:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430716, 334773, 46819, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field here as well as the carefullness you must have implemented to keep the flames burning tall. The alternating contrasting colours also make this perfect picture. I give you a 9 for this. The only thing that stops it being a 10, is that there seems to be something lacking, the colours are a little bland and there isn''t much going on, but the skills used to take such a photo deserve a high mark.</td>', 'I like the depth of field here as well as the carefullness you must have implemented to keep the flames burning tall. The alternating contrasting colours also make this perfect picture. I give you a 9 for this. The only thing that stops it being a 10, is that there seems to be something lacking, the colours are a little bland and there isn''t much going on, but the skills used to take such a photo deserve a high mark.', '2006-05-18 16:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430719, 334879, 43565, '<td valign="top">While you placed the ponies in the shot, it just does not come across to me as an artistic arrangement with lighting used to create a mood.  I do not care for the composition, the lighting seems harsh, and I would prefer sharper focus.</td>', 'While you placed the ponies in the shot, it just does not come across to me as an artistic arrangement with lighting used to create a mood.  I do not care for the composition, the lighting seems harsh, and I would prefer sharper focus.', '2006-05-18 16:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430720, 334678, 46819, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is a little too distasteful to achieve the higher marks, but I''ll give you a 6 for photographer skills...</td>', 'I think this photo is a little too distasteful to achieve the higher marks, but I''ll give you a 6 for photographer skills...', '2006-05-18 16:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430722, 334814, 41087, '<td valign="top">THATS AWEESOME</td>', 'THATS AWEESOME', '2006-05-18 16:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430728, 335062, 46819, '<td valign="top">Perfect photo, top ten for sure. The almost black and white low saturation makes the colour contrasts in this excellent. The moisture on the apples also brings this photo somewhat alive. Really well done, 10</td>', 'Perfect photo, top ten for sure. The almost black and white low saturation makes the colour contrasts in this excellent. The moisture on the apples also brings this photo somewhat alive. Really well done, 10', '2006-05-18 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430759, 333485, 43565, '<td valign="top">DNMC-no use of arranged inanimate objects.<br/> <br/>Photos closer to the 640 size limit usually score better than smaller images.  It also might help to put your subject off center.</td>', 'DNMC-no use of arranged inanimate objects. Photos closer to the 640 size limit usually score better than smaller images.  It also might help to put your subject off center.', '2006-05-18 16:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430771, 333665, 43565, '<td valign="top">My first thought was that this was an actual person, but on closer examination it appears to be a photo or painting.  I am not sure what the bowl and glass object in the upper left corner are for.  While I guess this technically meets most of the definition of a still life it just doesn''t look like a still life shot to me.</td>', 'My first thought was that this was an actual person, but on closer examination it appears to be a photo or painting.  I am not sure what the bowl and glass object in the upper left corner are for.  While I guess this technically meets most of the definition of a still life it just doesn''t look like a still life shot to me.', '2006-05-18 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430776, 334678, 43565, '<td valign="top">DNMC-no use of arranged inanimate objects.  At least I am guessing you did not arrange the pooh...<br/> <br/>This pooh is not very interesting to me.  If it had been a shell on the 1/3 intersecting lines I would probably like it better.  I do like the texture of the sand.</td>', 'DNMC-no use of arranged inanimate objects.  At least I am guessing you did not arrange the pooh... This pooh is not very interesting to me.  If it had been a shell on the 1/3 intersecting lines I would probably like it better.  I do like the texture of the sand.', '2006-05-18 16:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430779, 333836, 43565, '<td valign="top">DNMC-no use of arranged inanimate objects.<br/> <br/>This photo would work in a family album.  I don''t like the glare on the chalkboard.</td>', 'DNMC-no use of arranged inanimate objects. This photo would work in a family album.  I don''t like the glare on the chalkboard.', '2006-05-18 16:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
