(2432532, 333818, 56673, '<td valign="top">Technically not a still life?  Pretty colors but maybe could have used little higher F-stop to improve focus throughout.</td>', 'Technically not a still life?  Pretty colors but maybe could have used little higher F-stop to improve focus throughout.', '2006-05-19 00:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2432551, 335554, 56673, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  The flower is crisp, and the sky is gorgeous with the blue and clouds.  Not knowing if the flower is still growing or has been cut makes it hard to know for sure if this is a still life.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  The flower is crisp, and the sky is gorgeous with the blue and clouds.  Not knowing if the flower is still growing or has been cut makes it hard to know for sure if this is a still life.', '2006-05-19 00:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
