(2432591, 335151, 56673, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but my understanding is that "still life" means inanimate (not live)objects.  Live flowers are usually not still life. (I hate to be "DNMC guy" but you have to be fair to those who did meet the challenge).  Of course, if this is a cut tulip that only looks live, then shame on me.</td>', 'Nice shot, but my understanding is that "still life" means inanimate (not live)objects.  Live flowers are usually not still life. (I hate to be "DNMC guy" but you have to be fair to those who did meet the challenge).  Of course, if this is a cut tulip that only looks live, then shame on me.', '2006-05-19 00:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2432595, 332744, 56673, '<td valign="top">Fine line between landscape and still life?</td>', 'Fine line between landscape and still life?', '2006-05-19 00:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2432604, 334465, 56673, '<td valign="top">"No flowers were harmed when they were severed from the earth to make this photo." (Just kidding).  Beautiful colors, nice and crisp.</td>', '"No flowers were harmed when they were severed from the earth to make this photo." (Just kidding).  Beautiful colors, nice and crisp.', '2006-05-19 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
