(2434365, 335481, 35602, '<td valign="top">Color adjustment needs to be different.  This one has too much yellow.  Composition is way too busy.  Less items would have come off better.  Also, think the overall it just doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'Color adjustment needs to be different.  This one has too much yellow.  Composition is way too busy.  Less items would have come off better.  Also, think the overall it just doesn''t do anything for me.', '2006-05-19 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
