(2435174, 334682, 35947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  Nice colors.  I like how it looks like the whole thing is floating.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  Nice colors.  I like how it looks like the whole thing is floating.', '2006-05-19 11:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
