(2435233, 335293, 35947, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of a still life IMHO.  Lighting is a little harsh with the reflections on the glass.</td>', 'Perfect example of a still life IMHO.  Lighting is a little harsh with the reflections on the glass.', '2006-05-19 11:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435239, 333251, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very creative and a nice touch to have the drops in a musical shape.</td>', 'Very creative and a nice touch to have the drops in a musical shape.', '2006-05-19 11:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435376, 334030, 42826, '<td valign="top">YUM!!!  That looks so good!  very interesting...8</td>', 'YUM!!!  That looks so good!  very interesting...8', '2006-05-19 11:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435384, 335460, 42826, '<td valign="top">this is one of those pics taht needs to be a print!!!  awesome! 10</td>', 'this is one of those pics taht needs to be a print!!!  awesome! 10', '2006-05-19 11:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435420, 335228, 35947, '<td valign="top">Coming back for comments now that I take a minute longer to evaluate (and do it on a calibrated monitor at work) I can''t believe I sorted this in my lower group.  A few hot spots on the glass but very nicely presented.  Big bump up.</td>', 'Coming back for comments now that I take a minute longer to evaluate (and do it on a calibrated monitor at work) I can''t believe I sorted this in my lower group.  A few hot spots on the glass but very nicely presented.  Big bump up.', '2006-05-19 11:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435426, 334560, 35947, '<td valign="top">Creative and nicely presented.  The lighting could have a small improvement so not relecting on the apple.</td>', 'Creative and nicely presented.  The lighting could have a small improvement so not relecting on the apple.', '2006-05-19 11:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435443, 335088, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very cool and creative shot.  A still life but a little bit of a stretch since most of your subject is cropped out.  Gives it a nice abstract look though.</td>', 'Very cool and creative shot.  A still life but a little bit of a stretch since most of your subject is cropped out.  Gives it a nice abstract look though.', '2006-05-19 11:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435457, 334749, 35034, '<td valign="top">The elements and color of this image are very attractive.  I never know until I  acutally see the result, but I wonder how it would look if you lowered the camera toward the floor, so that the pillows in the background were behind the glassware and candles.  That might have given some lovely foreground color to the pitcher, and more completely dispersed the flower colors throughout the image.  A slightly less severe cropping might also make the picture even better.  A lovely combination!  6</td>', 'The elements and color of this image are very attractive.  I never know until I  acutally see the result, but I wonder how it would look if you lowered the camera toward the floor, so that the pillows in the background were behind the glassware and candles.  That might have given some lovely foreground color to the pitcher, and more completely dispersed the flower colors throughout the image.  A slightly less severe cropping might also make the picture even better.  A lovely combination!  6', '2006-05-19 11:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435459, 335062, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Only thing I can think to suggest would be a little more "uniformity" in the green apples (not all have stems).  Bumping</td>', 'Great shot.  Only thing I can think to suggest would be a little more "uniformity" in the green apples (not all have stems).  Bumping', '2006-05-19 11:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435464, 335536, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Not what I''d think out when shooting a still life topic.</td>', 'Great shot.  Not what I''d think out when shooting a still life topic.', '2006-05-19 11:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435523, 335317, 35034, '<td valign="top">What a lovely flower arrangement.  The composition seems a bit static to me--Iwonder if putting the lamp on a box (under the drape) to raise it higher, and moving it slightly behind the edge of the arrangement of flowers would have helped.  It also might help to have a more massive, and taller lamp.  Having both items make a fairly straight line across the bottom is what makes the static quality.  Colors are lovely.  A 5 that could be improved, I think.</td>', 'What a lovely flower arrangement.  The composition seems a bit static to me--Iwonder if putting the lamp on a box (under the drape) to raise it higher, and moving it slightly behind the edge of the arrangement of flowers would have helped.  It also might help to have a more massive, and taller lamp.  Having both items make a fairly straight line across the bottom is what makes the static quality.  Colors are lovely.  A 5 that could be improved, I think.', '2006-05-19 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435528, 333312, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very unique and creative idea.</td>', 'Very unique and creative idea.', '2006-05-19 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435538, 332598, 42495, '<td valign="top">The candle flame is a bit bright but I really like this.</td>', 'The candle flame is a bit bright but I really like this.', '2006-05-19 11:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435547, 335324, 35034, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Not enough contrast for my taste between the brick and the fire tool set.  Having the fire tools and basket close enough to vistually "touch" might improve the composition slightly.  6</td>', 'Nice composition.  Not enough contrast for my taste between the brick and the fire tool set.  Having the fire tools and basket close enough to vistually "touch" might improve the composition slightly.  6', '2006-05-19 11:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435551, 335338, 35947, '<td valign="top">DNMC! - You may think its a doll (ACTION FIGURE) but when you''re not looking he does move and is alive!  (Just kidding!)<br/> <br/>Very creative the one blade that cuts the pic in 1/2 is very distracting.  Should have titled it "Troll hunter"</td>', 'DNMC! - You may think its a doll (ACTION FIGURE) but when you''re not looking he does move and is alive!  (Just kidding!) Very creative the one blade that cuts the pic in 1/2 is very distracting.  Should have titled it "Troll hunter"', '2006-05-19 11:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435555, 334785, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great tone/color.</td>', 'Great tone/color.', '2006-05-19 11:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435561, 332690, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed/arranged.</td>', 'Nicely composed/arranged.', '2006-05-19 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435569, 333378, 35947, '<td valign="top">Let my apples go!  Beautifully done.  Love the brightness/color of the apples and the leaves.</td>', 'Let my apples go!  Beautifully done.  Love the brightness/color of the apples and the leaves.', '2006-05-19 11:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435572, 334866, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  A more solid/darker back ground would help IMHO.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  A more solid/darker back ground would help IMHO.', '2006-05-19 11:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435577, 334190, 35947, '<td valign="top">Small hot spot on the corner of the pepper otherwise an excellently done shot.</td>', 'Small hot spot on the corner of the pepper otherwise an excellently done shot.', '2006-05-19 11:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435582, 333362, 35947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro!  Great DOF and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful macro!  Great DOF and composition.', '2006-05-19 12:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435591, 334282, 35947, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch on the topic as far as a traditional still life goes.  Not sure if b/w works here very well.  It seems to make it more bland.  Can slightly see your reflection in the plexiglass.</td>', 'A bit of a stretch on the topic as far as a traditional still life goes.  Not sure if b/w works here very well.  It seems to make it more bland.  Can slightly see your reflection in the plexiglass.', '2006-05-19 12:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435597, 335568, 35947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Nice composition.  Can''t think of any improvement suggestions....  guess that''s why it''s one of my top 10!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Nice composition.  Can''t think of any improvement suggestions....  guess that''s why it''s one of my top 10!', '2006-05-19 12:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
