(2435725, 335375, 42869, '<td valign="top">This got a real laugh from me - great idea.  Only comment I would make is that there is too much background showing. I would have set up a tighter shot or cropped more but well done.</td>', 'This got a real laugh from me - great idea.  Only comment I would make is that there is too much background showing. I would have set up a tighter shot or cropped more but well done.', '2006-05-19 12:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
