(2436417, 334610, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry, DNMC.<br/> <br/>Main Entry: still life<br/>Function: noun<br/>Inflected Form(s): plural still lifes<br/>1 : a picture consisting predominantly of <i><b>inanimate</b></i> objects<br/>2 : the category of graphic arts concerned with <i><b>inanimate</b></i> subject matter</td>', 'Sorry, DNMC. Main Entry: still lifeFunction: nounInflected Form(s): plural still lifes1 : a picture consisting predominantly of inanimate objects2 : the category of graphic arts concerned with inanimate subject matter', '2006-05-19 15:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
