(2438208, 335555, 29011, '<td valign="top">bumping up. Great job with the lighting and composition :)</td>', 'bumping up. Great job with the lighting and composition :)', '2006-05-19 22:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438419, 334712, 53964, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a bit harsh, but I like the composition and angle of the shot.</td>', 'Lighting''s a bit harsh, but I like the composition and angle of the shot.', '2006-05-19 23:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438465, 335444, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful glow and a sympathetic still life study.  The combination of the jade-like eggs and the honey-warm basket is a lovely pairing of colours, textures and tones.  Also an elegant juxtaposition of "pre-life" (eggs) and "post-life" (timber basket).  I think this is what a classical still life is all about.  9.</td>', 'Beautiful glow and a sympathetic still life study.  The combination of the jade-like eggs and the honey-warm basket is a lovely pairing of colours, textures and tones.  Also an elegant juxtaposition of "pre-life" (eggs) and "post-life" (timber basket).  I think this is what a classical still life is all about.  9.', '2006-05-19 23:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438468, 334274, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely, classical and sympathetic.   7.</td>', 'Lovely, classical and sympathetic.   7.', '2006-05-19 23:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438478, 334785, 30364, '<td valign="top">First subtract all those people with a myopic definition of Still Life, then take away those who can''t recognise a good photograph anyway.  What''s left is not enough votes to lift this brilliant work above a score in the mid-5''s.  Hell, it''s so good it probably won''t even <i>make</i> 5!<br/> <br/>Presumably, in view of your wry title, you were prepared for the dismal "Not a Still Life" crowd.  But I''ll bet nothing will have prepared you for how seriously this will be underestimated as a photograph.  10.</td>', 'First subtract all those people with a myopic definition of Still Life, then take away those who can''t recognise a good photograph anyway.  What''s left is not enough votes to lift this brilliant work above a score in the mid-5''s.  Hell, it''s so good it probably won''t even make 5! Presumably, in view of your wry title, you were prepared for the dismal "Not a Still Life" crowd.  But I''ll bet nothing will have prepared you for how seriously this will be underestimated as a photograph.  10.', '2006-05-19 23:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438485, 332554, 59256, '<td valign="top">nice...</td>', 'nice...', '2006-05-19 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438652, 335463, 51802, '<td valign="top">Estes Park, Colorado!!!  My wife and I went there last fall for a vacation.  I took almost this exact shot!  What a small world.</td>', 'Estes Park, Colorado!!!  My wife and I went there last fall for a vacation.  I took almost this exact shot!  What a small world.', '2006-05-20 00:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438719, 333573, 326, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh... I love these things..lol</td>', 'Oh my gosh... I love these things..lol', '2006-05-20 00:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438725, 334465, 326, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and great composition!</td>', 'Lovely colors and great composition!', '2006-05-20 00:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438728, 335175, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, wonderful colors &amp; composition!</td>', 'Nice shot, wonderful colors & composition!', '2006-05-20 00:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439023, 333749, 57278, '<td valign="top">anyone who spends that much time putting pins in to a pear deserves an 8 at least!</td>', 'anyone who spends that much time putting pins in to a pear deserves an 8 at least!', '2006-05-20 02:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439336, 334513, 30364, '<td valign="top">Clean to the point of being surgical.  Beautiful toning job.  Unusual to include so many background elements but your foreground subject pair seem strong enough to carry it off.  8.</td>', 'Clean to the point of being surgical.  Beautiful toning job.  Unusual to include so many background elements but your foreground subject pair seem strong enough to carry it off.  8.', '2006-05-20 04:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439364, 334624, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very clever modern classic.  Love the fact that the diagonal bands of sunlight stop before the edge of the image.  It makes a solid barrier on the right that keeps my attention from wandering; I am instead left ricocheting around inside the frame.  Interesting and very creative.  8.</td>', 'A very clever modern classic.  Love the fact that the diagonal bands of sunlight stop before the edge of the image.  It makes a solid barrier on the right that keeps my attention from wandering; I am instead left ricocheting around inside the frame.  Interesting and very creative.  8.', '2006-05-20 04:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439369, 335455, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and textures.  Very nice contrasting shapes.  This has the feel of a fine painting.  8.</td>', 'Beautiful light and textures.  Very nice contrasting shapes.  This has the feel of a fine painting.  8.', '2006-05-20 04:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439375, 333172, 30364, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  9.</td>', 'Brilliant.  9.', '2006-05-20 04:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439519, 335258, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is so soft and gorgeous.  The pattern in the water is interesting and you made a good choice for crop and border.  The dead white space is perfect.  Great lighting.  My top pic...9</td>', 'This is so soft and gorgeous.  The pattern in the water is interesting and you made a good choice for crop and border.  The dead white space is perfect.  Great lighting.  My top pic...9', '2006-05-20 06:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439521, 334916, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is so well done.  Great choice on the framing and coloring.  Very attractive composition.  I love how the thinker feels almost understated by his surroundings and yet still feels like the subject all at the same time.  Good job.</td>', 'This is so well done.  Great choice on the framing and coloring.  Very attractive composition.  I love how the thinker feels almost understated by his surroundings and yet still feels like the subject all at the same time.  Good job.', '2006-05-20 06:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439525, 334513, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is very attractive.  I love the soft warm browns and the excellent focus on the glasses that you achieved.  Good choice on the glass &amp; the vase...great shapes and it''s nice that you didn''t choose two matching pieces.</td>', 'This is very attractive.  I love the soft warm browns and the excellent focus on the glasses that you achieved.  Good choice on the glass & the vase...great shapes and it''s nice that you didn''t choose two matching pieces.', '2006-05-20 06:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439526, 335444, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great attractive colors, warmth and light.  Nice shadows.  This is well done.</td>', 'Great attractive colors, warmth and light.  Nice shadows.  This is well done.', '2006-05-20 06:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439530, 334624, 55838, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Interesting light patterns and textures.  This one stands out.  Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Interesting light patterns and textures.  This one stands out.  Nice work.', '2006-05-20 06:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439532, 335056, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully done.  Great composition...the metal balances the web nicely (plus is just a very cool web).</td>', 'This is beautifully done.  Great composition...the metal balances the web nicely (plus is just a very cool web).', '2006-05-20 06:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439536, 335432, 55838, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Interesting composition...not oversdone.  I can''t imagine this any other way but white on white...good choice.</td>', 'I like this.  Interesting composition...not oversdone.  I can''t imagine this any other way but white on white...good choice.', '2006-05-20 06:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439541, 333058, 55838, '<td valign="top">I know some say that plants/flowers aren''t still life but they definetly are in this composition.  Great set up and perfect light &amp; shadow.  I''m glad the trowel is dirty too!  :)</td>', 'I know some say that plants/flowers aren''t still life but they definetly are in this composition.  Great set up and perfect light & shadow.  I''m glad the trowel is dirty too!  :)', '2006-05-20 06:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439543, 335454, 55838, '<td valign="top">Ha!  So cute.  It''s nice to see one of those little girls get out once &amp; a while.  It must get tiresome always being glued to the dashboard!  Made me laugh!</td>', 'Ha!  So cute.  It''s nice to see one of those little girls get out once & a while.  It must get tiresome always being glued to the dashboard!  Made me laugh!', '2006-05-20 06:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439548, 335062, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool idea.  Good choice on the green &amp; red and framing but I so want it all to be brighter.  Cool shot.</td>', 'This is a very cool idea.  Good choice on the green & red and framing but I so want it all to be brighter.  Cool shot.', '2006-05-20 06:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439552, 333588, 55838, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Here is another comment to add to the large collection I''m sure you received on this already.  Hilarious!  Great colors and the composition is genius.  The wall is perfect too.  Hey!...I just noticed the handcuffs!...naughty boy!</td>', 'Ha!  Here is another comment to add to the large collection I''m sure you received on this already.  Hilarious!  Great colors and the composition is genius.  The wall is perfect too.  Hey!...I just noticed the handcuffs!...naughty boy!', '2006-05-20 06:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439556, 333476, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  Excellent colors and attractive crop.  My eyes want the apple to be a bit more in focus though.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  Excellent colors and attractive crop.  My eyes want the apple to be a bit more in focus though.', '2006-05-20 06:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439747, 334669, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think at least you could have taken the time to straighten the lamp shade</td>', 'I think at least you could have taken the time to straighten the lamp shade', '2006-05-20 09:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439884, 334678, 31239, '<td valign="top">good dof poor subject</td>', 'good dof poor subject', '2006-05-20 11:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439889, 335295, 31239, '<td valign="top">high lights blown out and it would have been nice if the heart we more in focus</td>', 'high lights blown out and it would have been nice if the heart we more in focus', '2006-05-20 11:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439891, 334680, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of objects.  I think something needs to be closer to the foreground though.  (or maybe crop off the bottom) The composition makes me feel like the objects are shy.</td>', 'I like the choice of objects.  I think something needs to be closer to the foreground though.  (or maybe crop off the bottom) The composition makes me feel like the objects are shy.', '2006-05-20 11:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439894, 335139, 55199, '<td valign="top">The composition and lighting is nice.</td>', 'The composition and lighting is nice.', '2006-05-20 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439896, 334690, 31239, '<td valign="top">nice image, IMO if the backdrop was flatter (i dont mean ironed flad but the large curved removed) and more out of focus it would have made the subject stronger.</td>', 'nice image, IMO if the backdrop was flatter (i dont mean ironed flad but the large curved removed) and more out of focus it would have made the subject stronger.', '2006-05-20 11:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439901, 335174, 49489, '<td valign="top">doenst seem very in focus</td>', 'doenst seem very in focus', '2006-05-20 11:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439902, 333709, 31239, '<td valign="top">highlight blown out - it ruins what could be a good picture</td>', 'highlight blown out - it ruins what could be a good picture', '2006-05-20 11:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439905, 334020, 31239, '<td valign="top">if the cups at the front wer more in focus it would have been a lot better IMO</td>', 'if the cups at the front wer more in focus it would have been a lot better IMO', '2006-05-20 11:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439907, 335062, 31239, '<td valign="top">looks a bit dull but nice contrasting colours</td>', 'looks a bit dull but nice contrasting colours', '2006-05-20 11:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439912, 334748, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Not sure I like the DOF effect.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Not sure I like the DOF effect.', '2006-05-20 11:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439914, 335375, 31239, '<td valign="top">great take on the usual whole fruit version, bet you were full after eating that lot. well done.</td>', 'great take on the usual whole fruit version, bet you were full after eating that lot. well done.', '2006-05-20 11:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439918, 335442, 31239, '<td valign="top">nice image, but IMO the glass of the watch cuts across the image and ruins it for me.6</td>', 'nice image, but IMO the glass of the watch cuts across the image and ruins it for me.6', '2006-05-20 11:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439921, 335254, 31239, '<td valign="top">great play on a word well thought out</td>', 'great play on a word well thought out', '2006-05-20 11:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439924, 335258, 31239, '<td valign="top">with all that negative space i would like to have seen all the cup and saucer, the negatice space is not adding to the image IMO</td>', 'with all that negative space i would like to have seen all the cup and saucer, the negatice space is not adding to the image IMO', '2006-05-20 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439936, 333749, 55199, '<td valign="top">Seems like excessive treatment of a defenseless pear... lol.  Unique and nicely done, eventhough it doesn''t really appeal to me.</td>', 'Seems like excessive treatment of a defenseless pear... lol.  Unique and nicely done, eventhough it doesn''t really appeal to me.', '2006-05-20 11:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439945, 335431, 55199, '<td valign="top">Interesting pitcher.  I like the wine colored background... nice colors.</td>', 'Interesting pitcher.  I like the wine colored background... nice colors.', '2006-05-20 11:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439948, 335381, 55199, '<td valign="top">Creative and colorful.</td>', 'Creative and colorful.', '2006-05-20 11:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439962, 332873, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting; creative; great composition.</td>', 'Nice lighting; creative; great composition.', '2006-05-20 11:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439970, 334879, 55199, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  The DOF seems too shallow and/or there is camera shake.</td>', 'Cute idea.  The DOF seems too shallow and/or there is camera shake.', '2006-05-20 11:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439990, 334085, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting play; I think a warmer color would make this more appealing.</td>', 'I like the lighting play; I think a warmer color would make this more appealing.', '2006-05-20 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440018, 334795, 55199, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, nice lighting and DOF.  I feel there could be more space to the left of the head, otherwise its quite good.</td>', 'Interesting subject, nice lighting and DOF.  I feel there could be more space to the left of the head, otherwise its quite good.', '2006-05-20 11:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440038, 335386, 55199, '<td valign="top">Focus looks a little off.  The composition looks fine. As a mother, I am a bit offended by this... I think a different title would have been better.</td>', 'Focus looks a little off.  The composition looks fine. As a mother, I am a bit offended by this... I think a different title would have been better.', '2006-05-20 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440047, 335598, 55199, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes this difficult to appreciate.  Using a flash might fill in the dark areas and smooth out the bright ones.  I can barely see the egg yolks in the green bowl.</td>', 'The lighting makes this difficult to appreciate.  Using a flash might fill in the dark areas and smooth out the bright ones.  I can barely see the egg yolks in the green bowl.', '2006-05-20 12:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440091, 334855, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I''m not sure I like the contrast of the very modern looking background to the antique looking goblet.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I''m not sure I like the contrast of the very modern looking background to the antique looking goblet.', '2006-05-20 12:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440106, 335308, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice colors; a happy mood.  :)</td>', 'Nice colors; a happy mood.  :)', '2006-05-20 12:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440115, 334707, 55199, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this better if the perspective were more from the front.</td>', 'I think I''d like this better if the perspective were more from the front.', '2006-05-20 12:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440124, 333535, 55199, '<td valign="top">Humorous. :)  The winner is a little out of focus though.</td>', 'Humorous. :)  The winner is a little out of focus though.', '2006-05-20 12:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440141, 334539, 55199, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. :)  It definitely portrays your message. Not sure I like the cropping.</td>', 'Cool idea. :)  It definitely portrays your message. Not sure I like the cropping.', '2006-05-20 12:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440148, 335405, 55199, '<td valign="top">Creative and fun. I think a warm background under the plate would add a nice contrast.</td>', 'Creative and fun. I think a warm background under the plate would add a nice contrast.', '2006-05-20 12:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440209, 335341, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like the pot... cropping about two thirds of the siding would help place the attention more on the pot.  An additional object might enhance the mood also.</td>', 'I like the pot... cropping about two thirds of the siding would help place the attention more on the pot.  An additional object might enhance the mood also.', '2006-05-20 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440228, 335312, 55199, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the warm color of the egg and the colorful florals.  The foot of the wine glass is destracting. I think a crop on the line just above the back edge of the wine glass would balance the composition.</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the warm color of the egg and the colorful florals.  The foot of the wine glass is destracting. I think a crop on the line just above the back edge of the wine glass would balance the composition.', '2006-05-20 13:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440274, 334749, 55199, '<td valign="top">Looks nice. I''d like to see the bottom of the picture frame included.</td>', 'Looks nice. I''d like to see the bottom of the picture frame included.', '2006-05-20 13:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440288, 335541, 55199, '<td valign="top">lol. :)</td>', 'lol. :)', '2006-05-20 13:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440296, 335525, 55199, '<td valign="top">I feel like there is some message here that I just am not getting.</td>', 'I feel like there is some message here that I just am not getting.', '2006-05-20 13:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
