(2440416, 335291, 57229, '<td valign="top">This does not meet the challenge - inanimate but not an arranged composition of objects. Forum discussion has convinced me that this could be said to meet the challenge - I''ve adjusted the score accordingly.</td>', 'This does not meet the challenge - inanimate but not an arranged composition of objects. Forum discussion has convinced me that this could be said to meet the challenge - I''ve adjusted the score accordingly.', '2006-05-20 14:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440424, 332744, 57229, '<td valign="top">This does not meet the challenge - inanimate but not an arranged composition of objects. I''m modifying a little, as this could be said to be an arranged composition of one object. I''ll bump the score up a little, but I think there''s not much pictorial quality. Fairly good lines and proportions in the composition, but an ordinary white car having little or nothing (visually) to do with a spectacular land- and skyscape. Just my opinion, sorry.</td>', 'This does not meet the challenge - inanimate but not an arranged composition of objects. I''m modifying a little, as this could be said to be an arranged composition of one object. I''ll bump the score up a little, but I think there''s not much pictorial quality. Fairly good lines and proportions in the composition, but an ordinary white car having little or nothing (visually) to do with a spectacular land- and skyscape. Just my opinion, sorry.', '2006-05-20 14:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
