(2447690, 335060, 39919, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2006-05-22 21:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447697, 334693, 39919, '<td valign="top">Still life''s are about inanimate objects.  People don''t count.  If you had focused only on the fried bananas and made the people so out of focus that they were virtually unrecognizable as such, it might have worked.  But the woman in the green scarf is in better focus than the bananas.</td>', 'Still life''s are about inanimate objects.  People don''t count.  If you had focused only on the fried bananas and made the people so out of focus that they were virtually unrecognizable as such, it might have worked.  But the woman in the green scarf is in better focus than the bananas.', '2006-05-22 21:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447704, 334680, 39919, '<td valign="top">The more I look at it, the better I like it.  I am not quite sure what those objects are doing together like that...and that''s one of the things I think I like about it.</td>', 'The more I look at it, the better I like it.  I am not quite sure what those objects are doing together like that...and that''s one of the things I think I like about it.', '2006-05-22 21:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
