(2450957, 334281, 39632, '<td valign="top">almost doesn''t cut it for me...  also, I think I would have gone for a slightly larger depth of field.  All in all, nice attempt.</td>', 'almost doesn''t cut it for me...  also, I think I would have gone for a slightly larger depth of field.  All in all, nice attempt.', '2006-05-23 21:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450993, 334890, 46700, '<td valign="top">why didn''t you straighten this out??</td>', 'why didn''t you straighten this out??', '2006-05-23 22:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451012, 334748, 43309, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but I wish that the lighting wasn''t so harsh. Perhaps you should try using a softbox, or just diffusing the light somehow (by bouncing it off a piece of foamboard, or even using a piece of fabric over the light source). Good job though. Very nice! Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this picture, but I wish that the lighting wasn''t so harsh. Perhaps you should try using a softbox, or just diffusing the light somehow (by bouncing it off a piece of foamboard, or even using a piece of fabric over the light source). Good job though. Very nice! Good luck!', '2006-05-23 22:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451035, 335525, 10082, '<td valign="top">Nice image!</td>', 'Nice image!', '2006-05-23 22:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451040, 335596, 43309, '<td valign="top">definitely different...<br/>I like contrast of the fast food with the wine, but I wish the hot dog and fries were in focus. I also like the perspective and the way the table ends...and the rule of thirds kinda everywhere. Good luck!</td>', 'definitely different...I like contrast of the fast food with the wine, but I wish the hot dog and fries were in focus. I also like the perspective and the way the table ends...and the rule of thirds kinda everywhere. Good luck!', '2006-05-23 22:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451072, 333252, 10082, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.</td>', 'I really like this photo.', '2006-05-23 22:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451102, 335056, 10082, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. The composition is very nice and it does well in B/W.</td>', 'I really like this photo. The composition is very nice and it does well in B/W.', '2006-05-23 23:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451134, 334274, 36371, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this piece, but because they look so fake, I would have not included the grapes. The vase colors blend so well with the apples that I think the grapes were just overkill. But a nice photo and meets the challenge that everybody''s been hollerin'' about!</td>', 'I love the colors in this piece, but because they look so fake, I would have not included the grapes. The vase colors blend so well with the apples that I think the grapes were just overkill. But a nice photo and meets the challenge that everybody''s been hollerin'' about!', '2006-05-23 23:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451136, 335455, 36371, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. Looks like a painting.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. Looks like a painting.', '2006-05-23 23:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
