(2451356, 333749, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments. I scored this an 8 however I''m curious how this does given the theme of the challenge. I don''t know much about still life but from a pure standpoint this seems arranged and manipulated to how you wanted to present it so it fits the challenge, IMO. <br/> <br/>I can''t imagine how long it took you getting those pins in there and so evenly distributed. In addition to the uniqueness of this I like the color scheme and the lighting is perfect. I like the composition but I''m wondering why you just didn''t crop this tighter to eliminate that sensor dust. Hopefully that doesn''t hurt you.</td>', 'Returning for comments. I scored this an 8 however I''m curious how this does given the theme of the challenge. I don''t know much about still life but from a pure standpoint this seems arranged and manipulated to how you wanted to present it so it fits the challenge, IMO.  I can''t imagine how long it took you getting those pins in there and so evenly distributed. In addition to the uniqueness of this I like the color scheme and the lighting is perfect. I like the composition but I''m wondering why you just didn''t crop this tighter to eliminate that sensor dust. Hopefully that doesn''t hurt you.', '2006-05-24 00:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
