(2452338, 334785, 16241, '<td valign="top">why the hell does there only have to be one definiton for "still life"<br/>depends how far people wanna search, i found this:-<br/> <br/>-Still life - inanimate subject, either in the studio, or outdoors, normally arranged to make full use of form, shape and lighting.<br/> <br/>which means its still life.  it is in my book and 100% better than<br/>a lot of arranged ornaments.<br/> <br/>can not believed the narrow minded people.  end of rant. :)<br/> <br/>great photo btw.</td>', 'why the hell does there only have to be one definiton for "still life"depends how far people wanna search, i found this:- -Still life - inanimate subject, either in the studio, or outdoors, normally arranged to make full use of form, shape and lighting. which means its still life.  it is in my book and 100% better thana lot of arranged ornaments. can not believed the narrow minded people.  end of rant. :) great photo btw.', '2006-05-24 09:04:40.000000', NULL, 0),
