(2452521, 335444, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great choice for the pic... I had an emu egg once... we guessed at the cooking time of around 3.5 HOURS!!! It turned out perfect too... Hard boiled of course...<br/> <br/>One of the most interesting types of eggs I''ve ever eaten... I remember being struck by the beauty of the shell''s color too...<br/> <br/>Although the one we got was quite a bit more uniformly green... Variance in breed I wonder?</td>', 'Great choice for the pic... I had an emu egg once... we guessed at the cooking time of around 3.5 HOURS!!! It turned out perfect too... Hard boiled of course... One of the most interesting types of eggs I''ve ever eaten... I remember being struck by the beauty of the shell''s color too... Although the one we got was quite a bit more uniformly green... Variance in breed I wonder?', '2006-05-24 10:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
