(2452989, 333749, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats, reminds me of shots by Palmi Einarsson where he stitched up fruits and stuff like that.  <a href="//www.pedesign.is" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">www.pedesign.is</a> and look under "fine art color" and then "patching up nature".  Nice work!</td>', 'Congrats, reminds me of shots by Palmi Einarsson where he stitched up fruits and stuff like that.  www.pedesign.is and look under "fine art color" and then "patching up nature".  Nice work!', '2006-05-24 13:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2453062, 334274, 32754, '<td valign="top">This was good..I felt it would be in top ten, but it is a lovely and softly hued image.</td>', 'This was good..I felt it would be in top ten, but it is a lovely and softly hued image.', '2006-05-24 13:48:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2453078, 334969, 35804, '<td valign="top">I like that texture behind the lower part of the flower, but I can barely see it, certainly not enough to be distracted by it..anyway, the tones are great, so pumpkin pie and french vanilla...very nice.<br/></td>', 'I like that texture behind the lower part of the flower, but I can barely see it, certainly not enough to be distracted by it..anyway, the tones are great, so pumpkin pie and french vanilla...very nice.', '2006-05-24 13:54:27.000000', NULL, 0),
