(2453499, 335367, 58486, '<td valign="top">now that the challenge is over, I honestly feel like this score should have been higher but with the arguement about what is "still life" i understand and just greatly appericate that four people liked it enough to give it a ten. <br/> <br/>Not completely dejected for my first submission</td>', 'now that the challenge is over, I honestly feel like this score should have been higher but with the arguement about what is "still life" i understand and just greatly appericate that four people liked it enough to give it a ten.  Not completely dejected for my first submission', '2006-05-24 15:50:44.000000', NULL, 0),
