(2455990, 334536, 35720, '<td valign="top">Excellent work! Congratulations!</td>', 'Excellent work! Congratulations!', '2006-05-25 09:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2456115, 334513, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Congrats for your best placing. WOW a 4th is a great thing. I''ve never achieved even a top ten... Great image.<br/><b>Composition</b>: Very good. The glass and the jug aren''t centered, what helps the comp.<br/><b>Subject</b>: Nice election of the subject for this challenge. I''m not sure about the glass as a symbol of the night, but is a nice subject anyway.<br/><b>Technical</b>: absolutely perfect focus and use of DOF, with the subject in sharp focus and the BG blurred but not very much. The tonality of the image is great, love it so much...<br/><b>Improvement</b>: we''re in the group for learning, so even in this image I must find flaws...LOL. Well, sorry if I seem fussy, but the borders of the glass and the jug are a bit oversharpened (a small halo on top) and there are some drops on the left of the glass.<br/><b>Summary</b>: Really great image almost flawless.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: Congrats for your best placing. WOW a 4th is a great thing. I''ve never achieved even a top ten... Great image.Composition: Very good. The glass and the jug aren''t centered, what helps the comp.Subject: Nice election of the subject for this challenge. I''m not sure about the glass as a symbol of the night, but is a nice subject anyway.Technical: absolutely perfect focus and use of DOF, with the subject in sharp focus and the BG blurred but not very much. The tonality of the image is great, love it so much...Improvement: we''re in the group for learning, so even in this image I must find flaws...LOL. Well, sorry if I seem fussy, but the borders of the glass and the jug are a bit oversharpened (a small halo on top) and there are some drops on the left of the glass.Summary: Really great image almost flawless. Álex', '2006-05-25 11:01:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2456128, 335588, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: nice, with a good BG.<br/><b>Composition</b>: Not sure about it. It''s a bit busy for me. I don''t know where I''m supposed to look. There isn''t a clear focal point for the viewer.<br/><b>Subject</b>: meets the challenge<br/><b>Technical</b>: Lighting is good. Colors are very naturals, I like them. The BG is very nice. I''m not sure about the focus.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: Maybe another configuration of the fruits (you could try with not so many strawberries to be not so busy...). The focus could be shallower (maybe with one strawberry in focus an the rest OOF) or bigger (with everything in focus).<br/><b>Summary</b>: Nice shot of food.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: nice, with a good BG.Composition: Not sure about it. It''s a bit busy for me. I don''t know where I''m supposed to look. There isn''t a clear focal point for the viewer.Subject: meets the challengeTechnical: Lighting is good. Colors are very naturals, I like them. The BG is very nice. I''m not sure about the focus.Improvement: Maybe another configuration of the fruits (you could try with not so many strawberries to be not so busy...). The focus could be shallower (maybe with one strawberry in focus an the rest OOF) or bigger (with everything in focus).Summary: Nice shot of food. Álex', '2006-05-25 11:10:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2456133, 334693, 58123, '<td valign="top">oh.. i misunderstood.. i thought it means candid!! hehe. yeah, it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'oh.. i misunderstood.. i thought it means candid!! hehe. yeah, it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2006-05-25 11:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2456138, 334277, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Good idea for the challenge with a poor lighting<br/><b>Composition</b>: Composition works for me, it''s a good cropping.<br/><b>Subject</b>: meets the challenge. The circles of coffe add interest to the shot.<br/><b>Technical</b>: here is the main flaw, the lighting. This is one of the harder things for us the beginners in order to score high, IMO. It''s very clear in interior shots when your lighting is not good and that affects a lot to the score. Sorry. The colors are a bit dark.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: Obviously lighting.<br/><b>Summary</b>: Good composition. Keep working on improvement.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: Good idea for the challenge with a poor lightingComposition: Composition works for me, it''s a good cropping.Subject: meets the challenge. The circles of coffe add interest to the shot.Technical: here is the main flaw, the lighting. This is one of the harder things for us the beginners in order to score high, IMO. It''s very clear in interior shots when your lighting is not good and that affects a lot to the score. Sorry. The colors are a bit dark.Improvement: Obviously lighting.Summary: Good composition. Keep working on improvement. Álex', '2006-05-25 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2456179, 332787, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Funny and clever take on an original subject.<br/><b>Composition</b>: Very nice, with the descending line from left to right, well balance with the red on both sides.<br/><b>Subject</b>: Funny, original. We don''t have Dr Pepper on Spain, but they look antique.<br/><b>Technical</b>: as you say, the lighting can be improved, the shadows of the wall are, at least, strange. Colors are very natural.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: As you said, lighting. Hoping to see your new versions of the shot.<br/><b>Summary</b>: Funny, good composition and some flaws on the light.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: Funny and clever take on an original subject.Composition: Very nice, with the descending line from left to right, well balance with the red on both sides.Subject: Funny, original. We don''t have Dr Pepper on Spain, but they look antique.Technical: as you say, the lighting can be improved, the shadows of the wall are, at least, strange. Colors are very natural.Improvement: As you said, lighting. Hoping to see your new versions of the shot.Summary: Funny, good composition and some flaws on the light. Álex', '2006-05-25 11:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
