(2456893, 333378, 32754, '<td valign="top">sometimes I think maybe my images are not mainstream enough or copies of previous challenge winners..haha..doesn''t matter..I have to go wherever my vision takes me; and I like that direction.</td>', 'sometimes I think maybe my images are not mainstream enough or copies of previous challenge winners..haha..doesn''t matter..I have to go wherever my vision takes me; and I like that direction.', '2006-05-25 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
