(2457588, 335175, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post - <br/> <br/>Congrats on another top 10. I gaveyou an 8 on this one. Loved the colors and composition. Good twist to see something other than fruit and flowers. Well done.</td>', 'Trading Post -  Congrats on another top 10. I gaveyou an 8 on this one. Loved the colors and composition. Good twist to see something other than fruit and flowers. Well done.', '2006-05-25 18:51:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2457600, 333913, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post - <br/>This was probably attacked hard for DNMC. I believe I scored it lower for that reason myself. Overall the shot did not really appeal to me. The brightness of the sky seems to take away from the colors on the flowers. They just arent vibrant enough. As a general flower shot I think I would have liked to have seen a bit further down the stems and a bit less sky.</td>', 'Trading Post - This was probably attacked hard for DNMC. I believe I scored it lower for that reason myself. Overall the shot did not really appeal to me. The brightness of the sky seems to take away from the colors on the flowers. They just arent vibrant enough. As a general flower shot I think I would have liked to have seen a bit further down the stems and a bit less sky.', '2006-05-25 18:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2457619, 334712, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/>I gave a 5 on this shot. You definitley met the challenge and it was niec to see some different props and a different take on the challenge. But overall the shot just didnt work for me. The crop seems a bit weird with the steamer being cut off. The colors are a bit too orange and the glass bricks are ditsracting - they dont really ad dmuch. I think what would have been nice is seeing these items arranged on a solid piece of red fabric or something to allow them to stand out better without haveing to deal with the bricks or the table underneath. A good idea to start with - better execution would have scored you much higher.</td>', 'Trading Post -I gave a 5 on this shot. You definitley met the challenge and it was niec to see some different props and a different take on the challenge. But overall the shot just didnt work for me. The crop seems a bit weird with the steamer being cut off. The colors are a bit too orange and the glass bricks are ditsracting - they dont really ad dmuch. I think what would have been nice is seeing these items arranged on a solid piece of red fabric or something to allow them to stand out better without haveing to deal with the bricks or the table underneath. A good idea to start with - better execution would have scored you much higher.', '2006-05-25 18:58:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2457643, 333535, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/>I gave a 4 on this one. The focus seems really bad on this shot. Did you use a tripod? The background needs som ework as well. I think if you had gone with one color and laid the fabric out so that it didnt have a right angle but a nice soft curve up it would have helped alot. An interesting concept I guess, but not enough to carry it higher. This shot just didnt capture my attention like it could have.</td>', 'Trading Post -I gave a 4 on this one. The focus seems really bad on this shot. Did you use a tripod? The background needs som ework as well. I think if you had gone with one color and laid the fabric out so that it didnt have a right angle but a nice soft curve up it would have helped alot. An interesting concept I guess, but not enough to carry it higher. This shot just didnt capture my attention like it could have.', '2006-05-25 19:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2457841, 334277, 38496, '<td valign="top">From Ctp2:<br/> <br/>This is an interesting shot, that causes me to stop and look at it.  I''m not sure I''d really consider it a ''still life'' in the traditional sense.  It might have fit better under a different theme.  I like the idea, though.  The lighting and composition are OK, although, maybe just a tad dark.</td>', 'From Ctp2: This is an interesting shot, that causes me to stop and look at it.  I''m not sure I''d really consider it a ''still life'' in the traditional sense.  It might have fit better under a different theme.  I like the idea, though.  The lighting and composition are OK, although, maybe just a tad dark.', '2006-05-25 20:11:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2457852, 335324, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading POst - <br/>Congrats on a new PB. That is always nice to see. I liked this shot. My comments still stand. Great feel but a fuller basket would have been nice. Great shades of colors and wonderful detail with no focus issues at all. Well done.</td>', 'Trading POst - Congrats on a new PB. That is always nice to see. I liked this shot. My comments still stand. Great feel but a fuller basket would have been nice. Great shades of colors and wonderful detail with no focus issues at all. Well done.', '2006-05-25 20:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2457853, 332787, 38496, '<td valign="top">from ctp2:<br/> <br/>Very cute Idea.  Now I''m thirsty for a Dr. Pepper Ü.  I like the repetition of the color red through out the photo, and the descending heights.  Very nice composition.<br/>The lighting is a little ''off''.  The shadows on the background are a little uneven.  And the tulip buds could be a little brighter.<br/>Nice photo over all!</td>', 'from ctp2: Very cute Idea.  Now I''m thirsty for a Dr. Pepper Ü.  I like the repetition of the color red through out the photo, and the descending heights.  Very nice composition.The lighting is a little ''off''.  The shadows on the background are a little uneven.  And the tulip buds could be a little brighter.Nice photo over all!', '2006-05-25 20:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458029, 335595, 42125, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant!<br/>Nice soft tones.</td>', 'Simple and elegant!Nice soft tones.', '2006-05-25 21:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458065, 334274, 30454, '<td valign="top">This one is really nice Judy!! Lighting, composition everything is excellent.</td>', 'This one is really nice Judy!! Lighting, composition everything is excellent.', '2006-05-25 21:38:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458086, 334274, 51538, '<td valign="top">The fruit is perfect, the vase colour is perfect, the black background is perfect.  The grapes are perfect with that bluish yeast coating.  But it is the grapes coming out of the vase that bings me.  But I just figured it out, the classic way to do this would be to tip the vase on its side, like a cornucopia and have the ggrapes spill out.  That way you keep everything and get to make it look like natural chaos.... 0.02c</td>', 'The fruit is perfect, the vase colour is perfect, the black background is perfect.  The grapes are perfect with that bluish yeast coating.  But it is the grapes coming out of the vase that bings me.  But I just figured it out, the classic way to do this would be to tip the vase on its side, like a cornucopia and have the ggrapes spill out.  That way you keep everything and get to make it look like natural chaos.... 0.02c', '2006-05-25 21:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458107, 334277, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Laura -<br/> <br/>The first thing that strikes me about this photo is that the lighting looks a little too snapshotty. I would like to see this lit from several directions, and with a warmer tone. The shadow behind the mug is rather harsh. Coffee is usually associated with waking up in the morning (at least in the USA), so some lighting that also implies morning would make this a much stronger image. I like the composition, the coffee rings on the letter. The arrangement and idea are nice.</td>', 'Hi Laura - The first thing that strikes me about this photo is that the lighting looks a little too snapshotty. I would like to see this lit from several directions, and with a warmer tone. The shadow behind the mug is rather harsh. Coffee is usually associated with waking up in the morning (at least in the USA), so some lighting that also implies morning would make this a much stronger image. I like the composition, the coffee rings on the letter. The arrangement and idea are nice.', '2006-05-25 21:54:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458116, 335588, 55642, '<td valign="top">This looks like a smoothie waiting to happen... mmmm... This is a nice composition.<br/> <br/>Just a little bit of glare on the strawberries, but nothing major. My concern is with the focus. It''s sharpest in the center, but my eye is drawn to the ends of the bananas, which are out of focus.</td>', 'This looks like a smoothie waiting to happen... mmmm... This is a nice composition. Just a little bit of glare on the strawberries, but nothing major. My concern is with the focus. It''s sharpest in the center, but my eye is drawn to the ends of the bananas, which are out of focus.', '2006-05-25 21:59:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458128, 334513, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hey Richard -<br/> <br/>Nice clarity, good color, good light - easy to see why this scored so well. Congrats! I did not get the "night before" connotation. Possibly because the bed looks too neat. The background is a little busy, so I find myself wanting to look beyond the glasses more than I want to look at the glasses themselves.</td>', 'Hey Richard - Nice clarity, good color, good light - easy to see why this scored so well. Congrats! I did not get the "night before" connotation. Possibly because the bed looks too neat. The background is a little busy, so I find myself wanting to look beyond the glasses more than I want to look at the glasses themselves.', '2006-05-25 22:04:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458413, 334712, 53164, '<td valign="top">hello again,<br/> <br/>i gave this one high marks.  i really liked it. thought it worked well with the challenge. i liked how the props were assembled. it all seemed to make sense. i like the lighting and the angle of view. i really thought this was a well thought out and well executed photo.<br/> <br/>my gripes are just the minor white balance issues and a bit of a burn out on the bamboo. not really any major problems that i can see. should have done way better in my opinion.</td>', 'hello again, i gave this one high marks.  i really liked it. thought it worked well with the challenge. i liked how the props were assembled. it all seemed to make sense. i like the lighting and the angle of view. i really thought this was a well thought out and well executed photo. my gripes are just the minor white balance issues and a bit of a burn out on the bamboo. not really any major problems that i can see. should have done way better in my opinion.', '2006-05-25 23:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458458, 333913, 53164, '<td valign="top">hello again,<br/> <br/>i think you had 2 major problems with this shot and neither of them are your fault.<br/> <br/>1st, dpc hates flowers.<br/>2nd, dpc thinks flowers are not still life.<br/> <br/>other than that i think you would have done well. i gave it good marks. it is a nice shot. i like the soft clouds mostly. they add to the "softness" of the tulips.</td>', 'hello again, i think you had 2 major problems with this shot and neither of them are your fault. 1st, dpc hates flowers.2nd, dpc thinks flowers are not still life. other than that i think you would have done well. i gave it good marks. it is a nice shot. i like the soft clouds mostly. they add to the "softness" of the tulips.', '2006-05-25 23:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458518, 335324, 53164, '<td valign="top">hello again,<br/> <br/>i thought this was absolutely gorgeous. scored it very well.<br/> <br/>the only thing is no vibrancy. i think it is probably not supposed to have any, but that may have got you a bit more points.<br/> <br/>very well done.</td>', 'hello again, i thought this was absolutely gorgeous. scored it very well. the only thing is no vibrancy. i think it is probably not supposed to have any, but that may have got you a bit more points. very well done.', '2006-05-26 00:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2458541, 335375, 53164, '<td valign="top">hello again,<br/> <br/>absolutely loved this one. thought it was a great take on still life. i cannot beleive someone could actually score this a one.<br/> <br/>oh well, life is like that sometimes. well done in my opinion.</td>', 'hello again, absolutely loved this one. thought it was a great take on still life. i cannot beleive someone could actually score this a one. oh well, life is like that sometimes. well done in my opinion.', '2006-05-26 00:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
