(2460848, 335227, 46832, '<td valign="top">I knew this didn''t really meet the challenge category  requirements but what the heck.  I got back from vacation on the last day of the challenge and had a couple nice shots so I submitted it.<br/> <br/>The photo appears so small because I left it at 180 ppi and reduced the size until it was under the kB limit.  Next time I will drop the ppi to 72 before I resize it. <br/> <br/>Eight 10 votes and only three 1 votes - I''ll take that.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the compliments.</td>', 'I knew this didn''t really meet the challenge category  requirements but what the heck.  I got back from vacation on the last day of the challenge and had a couple nice shots so I submitted it. The photo appears so small because I left it at 180 ppi and reduced the size until it was under the kB limit.  Next time I will drop the ppi to 72 before I resize it.  Eight 10 votes and only three 1 votes - I''ll take that. Thanks for the compliments.', '2006-05-26 19:22:15.000000', NULL, 0),
