(2461619, 333535, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote on this, but I would have voted really low, the focus is off, background is bad ( try using a single color and if using cloth, iron it first)<br/> <br/>the split down the center isn''t working for me, and since you don''t enter any information I can''t comment on postprocessing.</td>', '[[trading post]] I didn''t vote on this, but I would have voted really low, the focus is off, background is bad ( try using a single color and if using cloth, iron it first) the split down the center isn''t working for me, and since you don''t enter any information I can''t comment on postprocessing.', '2006-05-27 05:33:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2461625, 335375, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>I really like this image, I didn''t vote on it but would have given it 8.<br/> <br/>the setup looks really good, even though I like to have some fruit left on the fruit ;)<br/>the only thing i dislike in the image is the white cloth or whatever it''s called under the fruits, it''s not old enough to look renaissance, and it doesn''t look like 20th century either. it''s just bright white and steals the attention from that great setup, that''s why you wouldn''t get a 10 from me :)</td>', '[[trading post]] I really like this image, I didn''t vote on it but would have given it 8. the setup looks really good, even though I like to have some fruit left on the fruit ;)the only thing i dislike in the image is the white cloth or whatever it''s called under the fruits, it''s not old enough to look renaissance, and it doesn''t look like 20th century either. it''s just bright white and steals the attention from that great setup, that''s why you wouldn''t get a 10 from me :)', '2006-05-27 05:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
