(2462320, 334513, 42125, '<td valign="top"><b>CTCP2 Gunnsi</b> <br/>First impression: Pure, crisp, bright, lovely duotone image.<br/>What can you do better?:<br/>Well you lucky skunk :-), again in the top 10 and now in the top 5.<br/>Almost a ribbon!!!<br/>The only thing I see is a tiny water drop on the side of the glass. Dry it off :-)<br/></td>', 'CTCP2 Gunnsi First impression: Pure, crisp, bright, lovely duotone image.What can you do better?:Well you lucky skunk :-), again in the top 10 and now in the top 5.Almost a ribbon!!!The only thing I see is a tiny water drop on the side of the glass. Dry it off :-)', '2006-05-27 19:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2462337, 334277, 42125, '<td valign="top"><b>CTCP2 Gunnsi</b> <br/>First impression: I want a coffe :-) and Why are there so many coffe stains? Dull colours. Nice idea, well executed. Good focus.<br/>What can be better?<br/>Brighter colours, fewer coffe stains on paper, use NeatImage to get rid of grains.<br/></td>', 'CTCP2 Gunnsi First impression: I want a coffe :-) and Why are there so many coffe stains? Dull colours. Nice idea, well executed. Good focus.What can be better?Brighter colours, fewer coffe stains on paper, use NeatImage to get rid of grains.', '2006-05-27 19:25:48.000000', NULL, 0),
