(2527756, 334513, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>CPT!!, oi!</b> <br/> <br/>The great tonality in this shot just <b>shouts</b>, sir.<br/>Very clean, almost sterile. <br/>Kudos for the "spicy" background not being distracting BUT enhancing. Amazing clarity and detail. Another great job, sir.</td>', 'CPT!!, oi!  The great tonality in this shot just shouts, sir.Very clean, almost sterile. Kudos for the "spicy" background not being distracting BUT enhancing. Amazing clarity and detail. Another great job, sir.', '2006-06-19 04:26:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2527783, 335588, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>CPTtoo, only later!</b> <br/> <br/>OKay, I''ll keep it short:<br/>(+)<br/>Nice subject -- or subjects, rather. The subtle vibrancy of the colours do take the cake for this particular shot. The choice of BG''s not really that great, but works nonetheless,<br/>(-)<br/>The shallow DOF was very detrimental as I bet a lot of people took of points for it. It was very distracting and compositionally unhelpful. A deeper DOF would''ve worked better.<br/>The shadows under the banana don''t help as well. A diffuser in front of the light, or maybe a repositioning, would''ve lessened (or eliminated) said shadows.<br/> <br/>Good luck on next challenges!</td>', 'CPTtoo, only later!  OKay, I''ll keep it short:(+)Nice subject -- or subjects, rather. The subtle vibrancy of the colours do take the cake for this particular shot. The choice of BG''s not really that great, but works nonetheless,(-)The shallow DOF was very detrimental as I bet a lot of people took of points for it. It was very distracting and compositionally unhelpful. A deeper DOF would''ve worked better.The shadows under the banana don''t help as well. A diffuser in front of the light, or maybe a repositioning, would''ve lessened (or eliminated) said shadows. Good luck on next challenges!', '2006-06-19 05:08:08.000000', NULL, 0),
