(2773574, 335399, 16004, '<td valign="top">i can see <i>why</i> this didn''t do great in the challenge (too much movable life in the frame, I suppose) but i don''t agree with the excessively low score of 4.1...  this is a very dramatic, dynamic composition, and the post processing is very stylishly done, and feels natural.  i think the lighting on the statue is really cool, and you wonder that if it were cropped above the demonstrators heads to form a 640 wide panoramic shot, it might have faired a lot better.   i''d have given it a 7 - based on photographic merits, having already knocked off 3 for the not meeting challenge issues.</td>', 'i can see why this didn''t do great in the challenge (too much movable life in the frame, I suppose) but i don''t agree with the excessively low score of 4.1...  this is a very dramatic, dynamic composition, and the post processing is very stylishly done, and feels natural.  i think the lighting on the statue is really cool, and you wonder that if it were cropped above the demonstrators heads to form a 640 wide panoramic shot, it might have faired a lot better.   i''d have given it a 7 - based on photographic merits, having already knocked off 3 for the not meeting challenge issues.', '2006-08-30 08:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
