(4051100, 334536, 37909, '<td valign="top">If the ball is transparent, it will invert the light going through it, much like your camera lens does when you look through it without the camera.  If the ball is reflective, then it will appear as you were expecting to see.<br/> <br/>This looks like a transparent ball.</td>', 'If the ball is transparent, it will invert the light going through it, much like your camera lens does when you look through it without the camera.  If the ball is reflective, then it will appear as you were expecting to see. This looks like a transparent ball.', '2007-09-02 21:11:55.000000', NULL, 0),
